<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.800" end="00:00:04.500" style="s2">Your honor, I need my husband and father</p>
<p begin="00:00:02.800" end="00:00:07.200" style="s2">-in-law both killed in battle,</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.500" end="00:00:07.200" style="s2">registered as dead.</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.100" end="00:00:11.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Vance, there&#39;s no need to rush to</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.100" end="00:00:14.600" style="s2">remove them from the rolls.</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.800" end="00:00:16.900" style="s2">What if both of them survived?</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.600" end="00:00:18.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your honor, you don&#39;t understand.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.900" end="00:00:22.100" style="s2">My husband and his father fell in</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.800" end="00:00:24.500" style="s2">battle. Under Liang law, fallen men earn</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.100" end="00:00:28.900" style="s2">death benefits. I am all the Vances</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.500" end="00:00:28.900" style="s2">have. I must look after the living.</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.000" end="00:00:34.900" style="s2">That bastard wants to die. Let him stay</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.600" end="00:00:37.100" style="s2">dead. In my last life,</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.900" end="00:00:39.300" style="s2">Victor and Julian Vance were reported</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.100" end="00:00:40.800" style="s2">dead in battle. I fought to keep the</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.300" end="00:00:42.600" style="s2">Vances afloat.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.800" end="00:00:45.500" style="s2">I scrimped to feed dozens in the</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.600" end="00:00:48.200" style="s2">household, but both men came back alive</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.500" end="00:00:49.200" style="s2">and well and married other women.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.200" end="00:00:51.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor,</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.200" end="00:00:53.300" style="s2">Julian, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.000" end="00:00:55.800" style="s2">you&#39;re alive.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.300" end="00:00:57.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 years ago, Julian and I got separated</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.800" end="00:01:00.500" style="s2">in battle and ended up stranded in the</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.500" end="00:01:03.900" style="s2">south. Hannah saved us. We owe her our</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.500" end="00:01:05.100" style="s2">lives. She&#39;s pregnant with my child now.</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.900" end="00:01:07.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena,</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.100" end="00:01:10.600" style="s2">I only made it back alive because Amanda</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.100" end="00:01:10.600" style="s2">risked her life to save me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.500" end="00:01:16.100" style="s2">I want to marry her.</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.700" end="00:01:17.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s good you&#39;re back.</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.100" end="00:01:19.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.700" end="00:01:22.300" style="s2">It&#39;s good you&#39;re back, but then I</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.800" end="00:01:25.300" style="s2">learned they weren&#39;t killed in battle.</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.300" end="00:01:28.000" style="s2">They faked their deaths and fled.</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.300" end="00:01:29.700" style="s2">They eloped with the Crawfords.</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.000" end="00:01:31.900" style="s2">Victor Vance wanted to please his new</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.700" end="00:01:33.000" style="s2">love. He even stripped mother of her</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.900" end="00:01:35.700" style="s2">power.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.000" end="00:01:37.700" style="s2">He made her serve the Zouse.</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.700" end="00:01:40.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t even cook porridge.</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.700" end="00:01:42.300" style="s2">Trying to kill my baby and me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.200" end="00:01:44.500" style="s2">With hands that useless, what good are</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.300" end="00:01:44.500" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.900" end="00:01:48.800" style="s2">Kneel here tonight and reflect.</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.800" end="00:01:56.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s burning. Mother, hold on. I&#39;ll get</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.100" end="00:01:58.800" style="s2">a doctor.</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.500" end="00:02:00.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll get better, I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.800" end="00:02:02.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.692" end="00:02:05.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll get through this.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.892" end="00:02:05.192" style="s2">Ah.</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.992" end="00:02:11.892" style="s2">Desales tortured mother to death.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.592" end="00:02:14.192" style="s2">Julian divorced me childless and</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.892" end="00:02:15.492" style="s2">jealous. My family [music] feared the</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.192" end="00:02:17.792" style="s2">Vances.</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.492" end="00:02:20.092" style="s2">They dumped me at the ruins.</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.792" end="00:02:23.692" style="s2">I lay there for three months.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.092" end="00:02:25.692" style="s2">One bowl a day kept me alive.</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.692" end="00:02:28.592" style="s2">If I get another life,</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.692" end="00:02:30.692" style="s2">you&#39;ll pay with your lives.</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.592" end="00:02:33.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never seen all the family&#39;s men died,</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.692" end="00:02:35.792" style="s2">yet calmly come to close their records.</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.292" end="00:02:39.292" style="s2">A true Vance matriarch.</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.792" end="00:02:42.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor Vance, Julian Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.292" end="00:02:44.992" style="s2">Since you chose fake deaths,</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.392" end="00:02:47.092" style="s2">I&#39;ll cut off all escape routes. Even if</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.992" end="00:02:49.292" style="s2">you dare return, you&#39;ll be branded</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.092" end="00:02:51.392" style="s2">deserters.</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.292" end="00:02:54.392" style="s2">That&#39;s another charge.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.392" end="00:02:54.392" style="s2">You can&#39;t escape.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.692" end="00:03:02.092" style="s2">Time to settle the scores from my last</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.892" end="00:03:02.092" style="s2">life. Everyone line up.</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.192" end="00:03:07.192" style="s2">The head of Vance Manor died in battle.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.692" end="00:03:08.492" style="s2">We can&#39;t afford to keep this many</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.192" end="00:03:10.992" style="s2">people.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.492" end="00:03:13.892" style="s2">Give everyone two months pay.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.992" end="00:03:16.292" style="s2">Pack your things and leave now.</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.892" end="00:03:16.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.592" end="00:03:21.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, where did you rush off to?</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.092" end="00:03:24.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, at the registry, I took Victor and</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.892" end="00:03:25.092" style="s2">Julian off the rolls.</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.092" end="00:03:27.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did?</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.092" end="00:03:29.792" style="s2">Do you know how serious that is?</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.592" end="00:03:32.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, they&#39;re dead.</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.792" end="00:03:34.292" style="s2">The war office&#39;s notice is clear. Victor</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.292" end="00:03:35.292" style="s2">and Julian fell at White River Crossing</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.292" end="00:03:37.892" style="s2">on the northern front.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.292" end="00:03:40.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But what if they&#39;re still alive?</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.892" end="00:03:41.892" style="s2">What if the notice is wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.292" end="00:03:43.792" style="s2">What if they come back?</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.892" end="00:03:46.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come back? Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.792" end="00:03:48.492" style="s2">deserters are executed. And not just</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.092" end="00:03:50.792" style="s2">them. Under Leon Law, deserters&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.492" end="00:03:52.992" style="s2">families face punishment. Men, penal</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.792" end="00:03:55.092" style="s2">conscription. Women, the Imperial</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.992" end="00:03:56.992" style="s2">Academy of Music.</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.092" end="00:03:59.192" style="s2">Mom, at your age, do you want to end up</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.992" end="00:04:02.092" style="s2">at the Imperial Academy of Music? Mom</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.192" end="00:04:03.694" style="s2">came from a family of scholars.</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.092" end="00:04:05.994" style="s2">She cared most about propriety and</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.694" end="00:04:10.094" style="s2">reputation. The Imperial Academy of</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.994" end="00:04:10.094" style="s2">Music would be worse than death to her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.194" end="00:04:17.794" style="s2">But, mother, face the truth today. Back</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.494" end="00:04:19.694" style="s2">then, you hemorrhaged during Julian&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.794" end="00:04:22.094" style="s2">difficult birth.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.694" end="00:04:24.694" style="s2">Your father-in-law chose the baby, then</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.094" end="00:04:25.794" style="s2">spent the night with Chloe next door.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.694" end="00:04:28.794" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that right?</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.794" end="00:04:31.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you find out?</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.794" end="00:04:31.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And that&#39;s not all.</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.294" end="00:04:35.494" style="s2">Your dowry notes in the shrine&#39;s secret</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.294" end="00:04:37.894" style="s2">panel</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.494" end="00:04:39.594" style="s2">came to $8,700.</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.894" end="00:04:43.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.594" end="00:04:43.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go see how much is left.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.694" end="00:04:48.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But they&#39;re still here.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.994" end="00:04:50.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at those notes again. Are they real</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.294" end="00:04:52.494" style="s2">or fake?</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.794" end="00:04:55.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $8,700.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.494" end="00:04:56.994" style="s2">Only these few $100 notes on top are</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.294" end="00:04:59.194" style="s2">real.</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.994" end="00:05:00.694" style="s2">The rest are all fake.</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.194" end="00:05:04.094" style="s2">Who did this?</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.694" end="00:05:06.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your son, Julian Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.094" end="00:05:09.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did he use it for?</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.994" end="00:05:11.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brothels, mom. This is the Vance family</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.594" end="00:05:13.294" style="s2">you&#39;ve cared for for decades. This is</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.694" end="00:05:16.194" style="s2">the son you raised.</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.294" end="00:05:18.994" style="s2">And in the end, they squandered the last</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.194" end="00:05:18.994" style="s2">of your dowry.</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.394" end="00:05:23.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, you see it clearer than I do.</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.894" end="00:05:25.394" style="s2">Tell me,</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.094" end="00:05:27.194" style="s2">what should we do now?</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.394" end="00:05:28.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sell the estate, move away with the</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.194" end="00:05:29.494" style="s2">cash,</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.294" end="00:05:31.894" style="s2">vanish.</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.494" end="00:05:31.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.194" end="00:05:41.294" style="s2">The estate store and key. I&#39;ve run this</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.294" end="00:05:43.894" style="s2">house for over 20 years.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.294" end="00:05:44.894" style="s2">I know what&#39;s worth the most in this</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.894" end="00:05:48.694" style="s2">house.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.894" end="00:05:48.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s great, mom. Take me there.</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.794" end="00:06:00.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These are Victor&#39;s most prized antiques.</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.794" end="00:06:04.395" style="s2">He prized them above his own life.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.494" end="00:06:06.695" style="s2">Now that he&#39;s gone, let&#39;s sell them all.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.395" end="00:06:06.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.295" end="00:06:11.895" style="s2">I see.</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.395" end="00:06:13.295" style="s2">So that&#39;s why you suddenly sent the</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.895" end="00:06:15.595" style="s2">maids away.</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.295" end="00:06:17.095" style="s2">Hiding behind closed doors to pocket the</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.595" end="00:06:19.295" style="s2">estate.</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.095" end="00:06:19.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.495" end="00:06:22.895" style="s2">You two jinxes, killing your husband</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.595" end="00:06:24.495" style="s2">wasn&#39;t enough.</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.895" end="00:06:25.495" style="s2">You want the estate too.</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.495" end="00:06:27.995" style="s2">Listen.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.495" end="00:06:27.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way.</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.995" end="00:06:35.495" style="s2">In my past life too, they used Victor&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.995" end="00:06:37.695" style="s2">favor to hound my mother-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.495" end="00:06:40.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was my own mother.</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.695" end="00:06:41.795" style="s2">How could I not see her off?</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.095" end="00:06:43.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once married, a daughter belongs to her</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.795" end="00:06:45.995" style="s2">husband family.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.395" end="00:06:48.195" style="s2">Madam, you now run the Vance household.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.995" end="00:06:50.095" style="s2">You must put this family first.</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.195" end="00:06:52.295" style="s2">If you leave, we&#39;ll run the house.</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.095" end="00:06:55.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s thinking of the Vance family.</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.295" end="00:06:57.295" style="s2">Besides, the house needs its mistress.</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.095" end="00:07:00.195" style="s2">Send a servant to the funeral.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.295" end="00:07:02.995" style="s2">Stay here, reflect, and pray to Buddha.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.195" end="00:07:05.495" style="s2">That shows the same devotion.</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.995" end="00:07:06.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor, she gave birth to me and raised</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.495" end="00:07:09.995" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.395" end="00:07:09.995" style="s2">Please let me go home.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.895" end="00:07:14.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this how you run my household?</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.295" end="00:07:16.295" style="s2">Kneel at the family shrine.</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.895" end="00:07:18.895" style="s2">Reflect on this.</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.295" end="00:07:18.895" style="s2">Go nowhere.</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.195" end="00:07:26.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today, I&#39;ll show you what it means to</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.295" end="00:07:26.395" style="s2">get what you deserve.</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.495" end="00:07:31.195" style="s2">Are you done?</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.680" end="00:07:33.795" style="s2">[music] Mother, father-in-law is gone.</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.195" end="00:07:37.295" style="s2">These concubines have no reason to stay.</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.795" end="00:07:39.395" style="s2">What happens to them is up to you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.295" end="00:07:41.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then throw them out.</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.395" end="00:07:42.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you want payback, mother?</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.495" end="00:07:43.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.495" end="00:07:45.295" style="s2">Of course I do.</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.795" end="00:07:46.995" style="s2">But Victor is gone.</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.295" end="00:07:48.695" style="s2">It&#39;s all behind us.</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.995" end="00:07:49.495" style="s2">I won&#39;t add to my sins.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.695" end="00:07:51.095" style="s2">Let them live.</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.495" end="00:07:52.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, please.</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.095" end="00:07:55.095" style="s2">Keep your fake mercy.</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.495" end="00:07:57.395" style="s2">Evelyn, Serena, don&#39;t push [music] your</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.095" end="00:07:59.995" style="s2">luck. My daughter married into Earl</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.395" end="00:08:01.995" style="s2">Manor. Lay a finger on me, [music] and</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.995" end="00:08:04.095" style="s2">she won&#39;t let you get away with it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.995" end="00:08:06.495" style="s2">You&#39;ll be dead.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.095" end="00:08:07.397" style="s2">Chloe&#39;s right. Lay a finger on any of</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.495" end="00:08:10.197" style="s2">us,</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.397" end="00:08:13.197" style="s2">and Earl Manor won&#39;t spare you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.197" end="00:08:16.097" style="s2">Then your Vance family will pay dearly.</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.197" end="00:08:17.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. You chose the hard way. In that</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.097" end="00:08:19.997" style="s2">case, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.497" end="00:08:19.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena,</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.497" end="00:08:25.097" style="s2">you dismissed all the maids in my</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.897" end="00:08:26.697" style="s2">courtyard. What gives?</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.097" end="00:08:27.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When word came that Gabriel Vance had</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.697" end="00:08:29.697" style="s2">died in battle,</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.997" end="00:08:31.897" style="s2">he was the first to sell off the family</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.697" end="00:08:33.897" style="s2">assets and run with the cash.</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.897" end="00:08:36.597" style="s2">Now I&#39;ve beaten him to it, and he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.897" end="00:08:36.597" style="s2">furious.</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.097" end="00:08:43.797" style="s2">I am Julian&#39;s lawfully wedded wife. I</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.997" end="00:08:46.497" style="s2">run this household, but you,</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.797" end="00:08:47.997" style="s2">a mere concubine, shouting at me as if</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.497" end="00:08:48.997" style="s2">we&#39;re equals?</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.997" end="00:08:50.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.997" end="00:08:54.297" style="s2">you dared slap me?</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.997" end="00:08:56.497" style="s2">Even Julian never slapped me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.297" end="00:08:58.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still pining for that dead man?</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.497" end="00:09:00.197" style="s2">Want to join him in the grave? As</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.297" end="00:09:01.897" style="s2">mistress of this house, I could be</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.197" end="00:09:05.697" style="s2">generous.</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.897" end="00:09:06.697" style="s2">And have you buried beside him.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.697" end="00:09:08.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena,</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.697" end="00:09:10.897" style="s2">so what if you&#39;re the lady of the house?</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.797" end="00:09:12.797" style="s2">I&#39;m part of this family, too.</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.897" end="00:09:14.297" style="s2">I deserve a share of the money.</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.797" end="00:09:15.597" style="s2">Who are you to mistreat me?</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.297" end="00:09:17.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.597" end="00:09:21.097" style="s2">We deserve a share of the estate. Today,</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.997" end="00:09:24.297" style="s2">none of you are taking those chests.</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.097" end="00:09:26.997" style="s2">Right. The men are gone anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.297" end="00:09:27.997" style="s2">It&#39;s four against two. We can still come</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.997" end="00:09:30.497" style="s2">out on top.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.997" end="00:09:34.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want to fight?</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.497" end="00:09:35.297" style="s2">You really think you can take me?</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.097" end="00:09:36.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.297" end="00:09:40.397" style="s2">Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.597" end="00:09:43.097" style="s2">You, when did you hire so many guards?</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.397" end="00:09:45.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew you&#39;d try something like this.</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.097" end="00:09:47.097" style="s2">On my way back, I&#39;d already prepared for</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.397" end="00:09:48.597" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.097" end="00:09:50.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.597" end="00:09:54.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was his favorite.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.897" end="00:09:56.397" style="s2">Just try laying a finger on me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.397" end="00:09:57.897" style="s2">His favorite?</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.397" end="00:09:59.497" style="s2">Sophia,</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.897" end="00:10:00.897" style="s2">so used to finding someone to hide</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.497" end="00:10:03.097" style="s2">behind?</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.897" end="00:10:05.497" style="s2">My father-in-law is dead.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.097" end="00:10:07.897" style="s2">Who&#39;ll dote on you now?</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.497" end="00:10:10.497" style="s2">I thought after all these years under</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.897" end="00:10:13.898" style="s2">the same roof,</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.497" end="00:10:16.498" style="s2">we had some bond, at least.</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.898" end="00:10:18.898" style="s2">I set aside money for each of you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.498" end="00:10:21.698" style="s2">You could each find a place to go.</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.898" end="00:10:24.598" style="s2">Then we&#39;d go our own ways.</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.698" end="00:10:24.598" style="s2">We&#39;d be even.</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.898" end="00:10:30.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was a misunderstanding.</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.398" end="00:10:33.598" style="s2">Serena, I knew you were dutiful, so</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.098" end="00:10:35.898" style="s2">thoughtful toward your elders.</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.598" end="00:10:39.598" style="s2">But you kicked down my door</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.898" end="00:10:39.598" style="s2">and tried to attack your matriarch.</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.998" end="00:10:47.398" style="s2">Don&#39;t expect me to honor our old ties.</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.998" end="00:10:47.398" style="s2">Mrs. Cole, come in.</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.198" end="00:10:53.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Higgins,</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.698" end="00:10:56.098" style="s2">the capital&#39;s top human broker.</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.798" end="00:10:57.898" style="s2">She deals only with elite families.</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.098" end="00:11:00.098" style="s2">She&#39;s handled concubines,</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.898" end="00:11:01.598" style="s2">800 if not 1,000.</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.098" end="00:11:05.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.598" end="00:11:05.798" style="s2">That wretch Serena is going to sell us?</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.398" end="00:11:10.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, aren&#39;t you beauties?</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.598" end="00:11:16.898" style="s2">This one&#39;s a little older,</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.598" end="00:11:18.498" style="s2">but her skin is smooth, and she&#39;s kept</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.898" end="00:11:20.898" style="s2">her figure.</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.498" end="00:11:24.798" style="s2">Those newly rich country folk</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.898" end="00:11:24.798" style="s2">love women who know how to serve.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.998" end="00:11:31.198" style="s2">This one&#39;s young and pretty, fit too.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.298" end="00:11:35.198" style="s2">Sell her to a remote, busy town.</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.198" end="00:11:35.198" style="s2">Let her taste being ordered around.</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.598" end="00:11:37.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.898" end="00:11:40.198" style="s2">uh</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.898" end="00:11:42.298" style="s2">That scared her into fainting.</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.198" end="00:11:45.098" style="s2">Fetch a basin of water. Let&#39;s see if</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.298" end="00:11:47.298" style="s2">she&#39;s really out cold.</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.098" end="00:11:47.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.298" end="00:11:53.798" style="s2">Serena, you [ __ ] My daughter married</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.998" end="00:11:56.398" style="s2">into Earl Manor. You dare sell me?</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.798" end="00:12:00.098" style="s2">She&#39;ll never let you get away with it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.398" end="00:12:02.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. She&#39;s Earl Manor&#39;s in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.098" end="00:12:04.498" style="s2">When her daughter gets here, you&#39;ll all</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.298" end="00:12:05.498" style="s2">pay for this.</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.498" end="00:12:08.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.498" end="00:12:11.998" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll wait for her to come.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.598" end="00:12:15.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young madam, Earl Manor&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.998" end="00:12:15.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, you&#39;re done.</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.599" end="00:12:19.899" style="s2">My daughter must have sent someone for</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.399" end="00:12:23.999" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.899" end="00:12:23.999" style="s2">You&#39;ll be on your knees begging me soon.</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.099" end="00:12:32.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, let&#39;s watch from outside.</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.999" end="00:12:35.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re here, your honor.</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.099" end="00:12:35.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s in charge here?</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.399" end="00:12:41.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am. What is it, your honor?</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.099" end="00:12:45.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your daughter&#39;s too jealous. Earl Manor</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.499" end="00:12:45.299" style="s2">can&#39;t afford a lady like her.</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.399" end="00:12:56.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what do I do?</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.499" end="00:13:00.099" style="s2">They divorced me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.999" end="00:13:01.799" style="s2">They kept my dowry too.</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.099" end="00:13:04.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could this be?</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.799" end="00:13:07.299" style="s2">You&#39;re a Vance Manor daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.599" end="00:13:09.199" style="s2">How dare they divorce you?</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.299" end="00:13:11.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just like my past life.</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.199" end="00:13:13.899" style="s2">With every Vance Manor dead, Earl Manor</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.199" end="00:13:17.099" style="s2">feared catching their bad luck.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.899" end="00:13:19.399" style="s2">They couldn&#39;t wait to send her back.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.099" end="00:13:20.899" style="s2">Chloe secretly took 3,000 tales from</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.399" end="00:13:24.499" style="s2">Vance Manor</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.899" end="00:13:27.499" style="s2">to get Earl Manor to take her back.</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.499" end="00:13:29.699" style="s2">This time I took the family funds first.</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.499" end="00:13:31.099" style="s2">Now try bribing Earl Manor.</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.699" end="00:13:34.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re done.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.099" end="00:13:37.699" style="s2">The mighty Vance Manor has fallen. Ah.</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.899" end="00:13:39.999" style="s2">My lady, I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.699" end="00:13:42.399" style="s2">Beat me or punish me as you like, but</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.999" end="00:13:45.699" style="s2">Grace is so young.</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.399" end="00:13:45.699" style="s2">Please give her a way out.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.899" end="00:13:50.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First, mother, have mercy. Spare my</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.599" end="00:13:54.199" style="s2">mother and me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.399" end="00:13:57.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Spare you? When did you ever spare me?</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.199" end="00:13:59.899" style="s2">My mother died in an accident.</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.299" end="00:14:03.399" style="s2">You kept me from her funeral.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.899" end="00:14:03.399" style="s2">You brought this on yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.499" end="00:14:09.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, I know you and Grace are like</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.699" end="00:14:11.899" style="s2">sisters.</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.099" end="00:14:13.999" style="s2">Please ask Evelyn to show mercy.</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.899" end="00:14:16.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like sisters?</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.999" end="00:14:18.901" style="s2">You spoiled her rotten.</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.701" end="00:14:20.701" style="s2">She treated me, mistress of this house,</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.901" end="00:14:23.401" style="s2">like a servant.</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.701" end="00:14:26.501" style="s2">She and Yvonne framed me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.401" end="00:14:26.501" style="s2">You called that sisterhood?</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.574" end="00:14:29.601" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.201" end="00:14:31.401" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.601" end="00:14:32.701" style="s2">I&#39;ll send her to Moon Reflection</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.401" end="00:14:34.801" style="s2">Convent.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.701" end="00:14:36.001" style="s2">The nuns there know how to set people</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.801" end="00:14:38.101" style="s2">straight.</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.001" end="00:14:40.401" style="s2">They won&#39;t let her turn out as vile as</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.101" end="00:14:40.401" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.801" end="00:14:48.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, wake up. Time to go.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.601" end="00:14:54.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, you wretch.</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.401" end="00:14:57.801" style="s2">How dare you humiliate me?</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.201" end="00:14:57.801" style="s2">I won&#39;t let you go, even if I die.</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.601" end="00:15:04.401" style="s2">Let go. [music] Let go.</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.901" end="00:15:06.301" style="s2">You animals dare touch me?</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.401" end="00:15:08.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You used to say, what&#39;s so great about</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.301" end="00:15:10.701" style="s2">being the wife? The concubine gets all</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.501" end="00:15:12.301" style="s2">the love. What about now?</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.701" end="00:15:15.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wretch.</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.301" end="00:15:17.501" style="s2">You just got lucky and became the wife.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.301" end="00:15:19.101" style="s2">I&#39;m telling you, one day you&#39;ll end up</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.501" end="00:15:21.801" style="s2">just like me.</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.101" end="00:15:23.401" style="s2">You&#39;ll die a horrible death.</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.801" end="00:15:25.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone dies.</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.401" end="00:15:29.401" style="s2">But you&#39;re so vicious.</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.701" end="00:15:31.301" style="s2">You&#39;ll go to the tongue-ripping hell.</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.401" end="00:15:34.701" style="s2">Last year, you claimed [music] I shoved</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.301" end="00:15:34.701" style="s2">you and caused your miscarriage.</p>
<p begin="00:15:35.301" end="00:15:38.901" style="s2">I had to kneel for 3 months, and it</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.401" end="00:15:42.101" style="s2">ruined my health.</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.901" end="00:15:44.901" style="s2">Now I&#39;ve sold you to a brothel.</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.101" end="00:15:48.601" style="s2">How much of you do you think</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.901" end="00:15:48.601" style="s2">those men will leave untouched?</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.101" end="00:15:52.901" style="s2">Mrs. Higgins, [music] how much for all</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.301" end="00:15:54.801" style="s2">four?</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.901" end="00:15:57.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t waste your time haggling. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.801" end="00:15:59.501" style="s2">pay $350 for all four.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.901" end="00:16:01.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $350?</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.501" end="00:16:04.001" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that a bit low? Madam Evelyn, you</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.601" end="00:16:05.501" style="s2">know none of these four are young.</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.001" end="00:16:07.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m only offering that much because</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.501" end="00:16:10.501" style="s2">we&#39;ve known each other for years.</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.901" end="00:16:12.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. It&#39;s better than nothing. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.501" end="00:16:14.001" style="s2">take it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.101" end="00:16:15.501" style="s2">But you must sell them as far away as</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.001" end="00:16:18.402" style="s2">possible,</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.501" end="00:16:19.702" style="s2">somewhere they can never come back from.</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.402" end="00:16:21.702" style="s2">Of course,</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.702" end="00:16:24.602" style="s2">you can count on me. [music] They&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.702" end="00:16:26.302" style="s2">never bother you again.</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.602" end="00:16:28.802" style="s2">Don&#39;t just stand there.</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.302" end="00:16:28.802" style="s2">Get moving.</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.302" end="00:16:34.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not leaving.</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.002" end="00:16:36.202" style="s2">I&#39;m General Gu&#39;s concubine,</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.302" end="00:16:38.402" style="s2">the Earl&#39;s mother-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.202" end="00:16:41.102" style="s2">How dare you?</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.402" end="00:16:41.102" style="s2">Delusional.</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.302" end="00:16:45.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.002" end="00:16:48.802" style="s2">Serena, please let me go.</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.802" end="00:16:50.902" style="s2">I&#39;ll serve you. Just spare me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.802" end="00:16:52.902" style="s2">My poor body can&#39;t take</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.902" end="00:16:54.102" style="s2">another man&#39;s abuse.</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.902" end="00:16:55.202" style="s2">Serena,</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.102" end="00:16:56.702" style="s2">Evelyn,</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.202" end="00:17:00.002" style="s2">you vicious women,</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.702" end="00:17:00.002" style="s2">you&#39;ll be struck by lightning.</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.202" end="00:17:04.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A concubine curses her mistress. Know</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.802" end="00:17:05.802" style="s2">your place.</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.202" end="00:17:08.902" style="s2">Want less pain?</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.802" end="00:17:08.902" style="s2">Then do as I say.</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.102" end="00:17:17.902" style="s2">Madam Evelyn, Madam Serena, we&#39;ll be off</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.602" end="00:17:20.702" style="s2">now. Call me when you have business.</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.902" end="00:17:20.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Safe travels.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.402" end="00:17:30.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, that was exhausting. Have some</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.002" end="00:17:33.102" style="s2">tea.</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.202" end="00:17:36.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, I finally had my say.</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.102" end="00:17:39.102" style="s2">I endured seductresses for 23 years.</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.702" end="00:17:42.202" style="s2">Since Chloe entered this house, I knew</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.102" end="00:17:42.202" style="s2">my life was over.</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.002" end="00:17:47.902" style="s2">I used to think</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.602" end="00:17:50.602" style="s2">I was the lady of the house. I had to</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.902" end="00:17:52.302" style="s2">look proper, gracious, and virtuous.</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.602" end="00:17:54.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But, mother,</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.302" end="00:17:57.302" style="s2">more than being a lady,</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.602" end="00:17:59.202" style="s2">I want to be myself.</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.302" end="00:18:02.002" style="s2">Why must marriage mean silence and</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.202" end="00:18:04.202" style="s2">submission at others&#39; mercy?</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.002" end="00:18:05.502" style="s2">No one will shield us. We&#39;ll shield</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.202" end="00:18:06.902" style="s2">ourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.502" end="00:18:10.002" style="s2">We&#39;ll fight free.</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.902" end="00:18:12.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MM, I&#39;ve lived most of my life,</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.002" end="00:18:14.502" style="s2">but you see life more clearly.</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.702" end="00:18:16.702" style="s2">I&#39;ll listen to you</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.502" end="00:18:18.702" style="s2">and live for myself.</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.702" end="00:18:20.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is only the start.</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.702" end="00:18:24.103" style="s2">The The family owes us.</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.703" end="00:18:24.103" style="s2">We&#39;ll collect with interest.</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.403" end="00:18:30.203" style="s2">If they want to play dead, let&#39;s make it</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.403" end="00:18:33.603" style="s2">convincing.</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.203" end="00:18:36.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, if you&#39;re hurting, let it out.</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.603" end="00:18:37.103" style="s2">Cry. I know you&#39;ve suffered all these</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.203" end="00:18:38.903" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.103" end="00:18:41.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Crying won&#39;t be enough.</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.903" end="00:18:44.203" style="s2">I&#39;ll tell everyone Victor and Julian</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.603" end="00:18:48.003" style="s2">Vance really died in battle.</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.203" end="00:18:48.003" style="s2">They&#39;ll never return in this lifetime.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.503" end="00:18:56.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian, why do you follow Victor to his</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.803" end="00:18:58.703" style="s2">grave? My son, you didn&#39;t leave Serena a</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.203" end="00:19:00.403" style="s2">single child. How will she get through</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.703" end="00:19:02.603" style="s2">life alone?</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.403" end="00:19:04.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What curse befell the Vances? Both</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.603" end="00:19:07.003" style="s2">father and son are gone.</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.903" end="00:19:09.303" style="s2">What a family tragedy. White River</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.003" end="00:19:11.103" style="s2">Crossing fell too.</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.303" end="00:19:12.503" style="s2">His Majesty spared Vance Manor since</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.103" end="00:19:13.903" style="s2">only the mother and daughter-in-law</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.503" end="00:19:15.103" style="s2">remain.</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.903" end="00:19:17.703" style="s2">Yes, yes.</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.103" end="00:19:19.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father-in-law, my husband, rest in</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.703" end="00:19:24.103" style="s2">peace.</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.303" end="00:19:24.103" style="s2">Victor and Julian don&#39;t come back alive.</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.003" end="00:19:31.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you hear? The Vance father and son</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.203" end="00:19:33.003" style="s2">died at war. How sad. Both widows, the</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.303" end="00:19:36.003" style="s2">mother and daughter-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.003" end="00:19:37.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. They just held a big funeral.</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.003" end="00:19:39.103" style="s2">The young Vance wife sobbed her heart</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.803" end="00:19:40.803" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.103" end="00:19:43.303" style="s2">That tear-streaked face made you ache</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.803" end="00:19:43.303" style="s2">for her.</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.703" end="00:19:47.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That fool Serena.</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.603" end="00:19:48.503" style="s2">She&#39;s surely still [music] mourning at</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.103" end="00:19:52.203" style="s2">my altar,</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.503" end="00:19:52.203" style="s2">loyally guarding my fortune.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.303" end="00:19:56.903" style="s2">They&#39;d never guess [music] we&#39;re living</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.303" end="00:19:58.603" style="s2">it up down south right now.</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.903" end="00:20:00.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.603" end="00:20:03.503" style="s2">Our plan is flawless.</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.803" end="00:20:05.303" style="s2">We dodged the bloodshed of war and those</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.503" end="00:20:08.503" style="s2">two keep [music] up appearances for us</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.303" end="00:20:12.203" style="s2">till we go back after having our fun.</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.503" end="00:20:12.203" style="s2">Who knows how excited they&#39;ll be.</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.303" end="00:20:15.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Over the next 3 days, we were run</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.203" end="00:20:16.903" style="s2">ragged.</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.303" end="00:20:20.403" style="s2">We rushed to sell the homes and shops at</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.903" end="00:20:20.403" style="s2">70% of market value.</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.505" end="00:20:34.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom suddenly seemed like someone else.</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.605" end="00:20:36.405" style="s2">No, not changed. This was who she&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.205" end="00:20:38.705" style="s2">always been. The household had kept her</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.405" end="00:20:40.505" style="s2">trapped for 20 years.</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.705" end="00:20:44.705" style="s2">Mom, we couldn&#39;t have finished the</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.505" end="00:20:46.105" style="s2">transfers so quickly without you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.705" end="00:20:48.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What effort?</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.105" end="00:20:51.605" style="s2">After 20 years running Vance Manor, this</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.905" end="00:20:53.905" style="s2">was nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.605" end="00:20:55.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, young madam, all houses, shops,</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.905" end="00:20:57.705" style="s2">and land have been transferred.</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.805" end="00:20:59.105" style="s2">The money&#39;s all been counted.</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.705" end="00:21:00.505" style="s2">$8,000 in all.</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.105" end="00:21:02.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.505" end="00:21:04.905" style="s2">With this money to live on,</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.505" end="00:21:07.305" style="s2">from now on, you and I won&#39;t have to bow</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.905" end="00:21:09.205" style="s2">to anyone again.</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.305" end="00:21:11.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve had the carriage prepared. We leave</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.205" end="00:21:15.705" style="s2">at dawn tomorrow. Armed escorts will</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.405" end="00:21:15.705" style="s2">follow us and guard us the whole way.</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.805" end="00:21:29.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor, Julian,</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.005" end="00:21:32.105" style="s2">once you&#39;re done having your fun and</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.705" end="00:21:35.505" style="s2">find Vance Manor has vanished, what will</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.105" end="00:21:35.505" style="s2">the looks on your faces be?</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.205" end="00:21:42.105" style="s2">Let&#39;s go, mom. We&#39;re never coming back.</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.305" end="00:21:50.705" style="s2">From now on, nothing in the Vance family</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.805" end="00:21:53.205" style="s2">concerns me. I&#39;m taking mom to find true</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.705" end="00:21:53.205" style="s2">freedom.</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.105" end="00:22:01.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve walked for weeks. Peony City at</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.905" end="00:22:03.905" style="s2">last.</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.805" end="00:22:06.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, ever seen peonies? These are</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.905" end="00:22:10.705" style="s2">Peony City&#39;s famous peony gardens.</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.505" end="00:22:10.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve only seen peonies in paintings.</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.905" end="00:22:17.005" style="s2">In all my 47 years,</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.605" end="00:22:19.505" style="s2">I never knew the world was this big.</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.005" end="00:22:22.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only peonies truly reign.</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.505" end="00:22:24.305" style="s2">Their blooms stir the capital.</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.305" end="00:22:25.406" style="s2">Now that I&#39;ve seen them, they live up to</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.305" end="00:22:28.306" style="s2">the hype.</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.406" end="00:22:30.506" style="s2">Mother, they&#39;re 100 times lovelier than</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.306" end="00:22:30.506" style="s2">art.</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.506" end="00:22:39.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To see such beauty now</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.906" end="00:22:39.606" style="s2">makes this life worthwhile.</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.906" end="00:22:44.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Old madam hasn&#39;t laughed like that in</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.706" end="00:22:46.806" style="s2">ages.</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.706" end="00:22:49.306" style="s2">Since she married into Vance Manor,</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.806" end="00:22:52.306" style="s2">she&#39;s never once stopped frowning.</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.306" end="00:22:54.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, mom&#39;s had a hard life.</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.306" end="00:22:57.006" style="s2">Now she can let go of the past</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.406" end="00:23:00.806" style="s2">and enjoy the world&#39;s beauty.</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.006" end="00:23:00.806" style="s2">It&#39;s all I want as her daughter-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.806" end="00:23:08.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, peony gardens are gorgeous.</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.906" end="00:23:10.606" style="s2">I lost track of time looking at them.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.606" end="00:23:13.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Glad you like it, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.606" end="00:23:15.706" style="s2">5 days in Peony City to enjoy spring.</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.606" end="00:23:19.106" style="s2">When we&#39;ve seen it all, on to Grand</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.706" end="00:23:20.306" style="s2">Canal City for Southern Mist and Rain.</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.106" end="00:23:23.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.306" end="00:23:23.206" style="s2">You&#39;re in charge.</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.706" end="00:23:26.806" style="s2">Boat woman, your sculling boat looks</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.906" end="00:23:28.506" style="s2">fun.</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.806" end="00:23:31.306" style="s2">I&#39;d like to try.</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.506" end="00:23:34.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You must be joking, old madam. Sculling</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.306" end="00:23:38.106" style="s2">looks easy, but it takes some finesse.</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.106" end="00:23:38.106" style="s2">If you don&#39;t mind, I can show you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.506" end="00:23:42.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d love that.</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.106" end="00:23:42.506" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.306" end="00:23:48.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, old madam, watch out.</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.706" end="00:23:50.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ha, what a thrill.</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.706" end="00:23:51.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sculling looks so effortless, but it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.706" end="00:23:55.106" style="s2">hard work.</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.906" end="00:23:56.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ha, I&#39;m glad you&#39;re okay, old madam. You</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.106" end="00:23:58.806" style="s2">scared me half to death.</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.706" end="00:24:00.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll teach you slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.806" end="00:24:02.306" style="s2">Just be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.206" end="00:24:04.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother never laughed like that in my</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.306" end="00:24:07.206" style="s2">last life.</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.406" end="00:24:10.906" style="s2">She prayed all day in the shrine.</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.206" end="00:24:15.006" style="s2">Always so meek and submissive.</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.906" end="00:24:18.046" style="s2">Now she&#39;s finally herself again.</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.006" end="00:24:20.066" style="s2">Evelyn, take it slow. No rush.</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.046" end="00:24:20.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.106" end="00:24:25.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ladies, lucky you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.906" end="00:24:26.606" style="s2">Grand Canal City&#39;s Lantern Festival is</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.506" end="00:24:28.107" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.606" end="00:24:30.908" style="s2">Acrobats are here.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.107" end="00:24:30.908" style="s2">It&#39;s quite a scene.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.607" end="00:24:38.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, want to go take a look?</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.107" end="00:24:41.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.908" end="00:24:44.007" style="s2">Let&#39;s see what food and fun they&#39;ve got.</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.307" end="00:24:44.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sounds fun.</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.107" end="00:24:49.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.207" end="00:24:55.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, that&#39;s Victor.</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.107" end="00:24:59.207" style="s2">Why are they here?</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.107" end="00:25:00.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hannah, look at that lovely lantern.</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.207" end="00:25:02.107" style="s2">Would you like one?</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.207" end="00:25:04.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s up to you, Victor.</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.107" end="00:25:06.408" style="s2">If it&#39;s from you, I&#39;ll love it no matter</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.107" end="00:25:06.408" style="s2">what.</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.707" end="00:25:13.307" style="s2">They&#39;re really alive.</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.408" end="00:25:13.307" style="s2">Then why didn&#39;t they come back for us?</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.507" end="00:25:18.107" style="s2">Why are they out having fun?</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.507" end="00:25:20.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you saw them. They never died in</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.107" end="00:25:23.507" style="s2">battle. They wanted to desert, so they</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.507" end="00:25:26.707" style="s2">faked their deaths.</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.507" end="00:25:26.707" style="s2">Now they&#39;re living it up.</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.807" end="00:25:33.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.807" end="00:25:35.807" style="s2">How could they be so heartless?</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.107" end="00:25:35.807" style="s2">They left us.</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.908" end="00:25:40.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, we broke free of the Vance family</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.408" end="00:25:42.507" style="s2">prison. We can finally live on our own</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.807" end="00:25:44.207" style="s2">terms.</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.507" end="00:25:45.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you want to go back and take more</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.207" end="00:25:47.607" style="s2">abuse?</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.607" end="00:25:48.307" style="s2">To be trapped and mistreated all over</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.607" end="00:25:49.908" style="s2">again?</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.307" end="00:25:52.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Serena.</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.908" end="00:25:54.507" style="s2">I&#39;ll do as you say.</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.107" end="00:25:57.107" style="s2">No more Vance manner for us.</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.507" end="00:26:00.207" style="s2">From now on,</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.107" end="00:26:02.908" style="s2">Victor and Julian are both dead to us.</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.207" end="00:26:05.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian, I want that hairpin too. It</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.908" end="00:26:06.707" style="s2">would go perfectly with my outfit. Will</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.007" end="00:26:09.707" style="s2">you buy it for me?</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.707" end="00:26:11.908" style="s2">Mom, don&#39;t turn around.</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.707" end="00:26:13.908" style="s2">Don&#39;t let him see us. Let&#39;s get back to</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.908" end="00:26:16.807" style="s2">the inn.</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.908" end="00:26:19.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, I&#39;ll follow your lead.</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.807" end="00:26:21.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That young lady looks familiar.</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.607" end="00:26:24.107" style="s2">Have we met somewhere before?</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.307" end="00:26:26.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Did he recognize us?</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.107" end="00:26:28.207" style="s2">No, he can&#39;t find out it&#39;s us,</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.707" end="00:26:31.109" style="s2">or everything we&#39;ve done will be for</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.207" end="00:26:33.209" style="s2">nothing. Mom, go on ahead. I&#39;ll catch</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.109" end="00:26:33.209" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.609" end="00:26:37.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, mad horse for sale.</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.509" end="00:26:41.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I twisted my ankle.</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.809" end="00:26:41.309" style="s2">What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.509" end="00:26:53.809" style="s2">Why are you ignoring me?</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.909" end="00:26:57.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you get so careless?</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.909" end="00:26:58.309" style="s2">Here, let me see.</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.309" end="00:27:00.809" style="s2">Is it bad?</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.309" end="00:27:02.809" style="s2">Does it hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.809" end="00:27:05.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s your fault.</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.809" end="00:27:06.309" style="s2">You saw some seductress and forgot all</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.009" end="00:27:09.209" style="s2">about me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.309" end="00:27:10.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. It&#39;s my fault. I neglected</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.209" end="00:27:14.509" style="s2">you, Amanda.</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.709" end="00:27:17.509" style="s2">Come, let me rub your foot, darling.</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.509" end="00:27:17.509" style="s2">I&#39;ll rub the pain away.</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.109" end="00:27:26.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.809" end="00:27:29.509" style="s2">My heart was pounding back there.</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.409" end="00:27:31.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine. I doubt he recognized me. Even</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.509" end="00:27:33.209" style="s2">if he did, he&#39;d never expose me in</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.509" end="00:27:35.409" style="s2">public.</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.209" end="00:27:37.609" style="s2">Mom, don&#39;t forget</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.409" end="00:27:40.109" style="s2">they&#39;re deserters now.</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.609" end="00:27:42.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, you&#39;re so calm.</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.109" end="00:27:45.309" style="s2">Did you know from the start?</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.909" end="00:27:47.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, we shouldn&#39;t stay. We&#39;ll talk more</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.309" end="00:27:47.809" style="s2">at the end.</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.109" end="00:27:54.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare they?</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.809" end="00:27:56.809" style="s2">They never set foot on a battlefield.</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.309" end="00:27:59.809" style="s2">What a disgrace.</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.809" end="00:28:02.809" style="s2">Victor&#39;s useless, fine. But how did I</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.809" end="00:28:05.509" style="s2">raise such a pathetic son?</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.809" end="00:28:07.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, don&#39;t get sick over it. Dead or</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.509" end="00:28:10.309" style="s2">alive, it doesn&#39;t matter. They&#39;re off</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.909" end="00:28:11.809" style="s2">the rolls already. To me, they&#39;re as</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.309" end="00:28:14.609" style="s2">good as dead.</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.809" end="00:28:15.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, I had no idea you could think so</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.609" end="00:28:17.709" style="s2">sharply.</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.409" end="00:28:20.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t tell mother I was reborn.</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.709" end="00:28:20.809" style="s2">She&#39;d never believe me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.509" end="00:28:25.909" style="s2">Mother, don&#39;t blame me for being cruel.</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.909" end="00:28:27.809" style="s2">They abandoned us long ago. Why not</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.909" end="00:28:30.009" style="s2">erase our names too and cut ties for</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.809" end="00:28:32.809" style="s2">good? Even if their desertion comes to</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.009" end="00:28:34.410" style="s2">light, it won&#39;t drag us down with them.</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.809" end="00:28:37.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Child, how could I blame</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.410" end="00:28:39.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you? I&#39;m only hurting for you. You</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.210" end="00:28:42.410" style="s2">carried all this alone. When Julian</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.910" end="00:28:46.010" style="s2">deserted and faked his death,</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.410" end="00:28:46.010" style="s2">it must have hurt terribly.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.210" end="00:28:51.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, I thought you&#39;d blame me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.410" end="00:28:52.010" style="s2">We&#39;re cutting Julian off from any way</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.010" end="00:28:55.510" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.010" end="00:28:57.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father first. Father leaves, son flees.</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.510" end="00:28:59.510" style="s2">Husband over wife.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.310" end="00:29:01.310" style="s2">He strays, she may leave.</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.510" end="00:29:02.710" style="s2">Julian&#39;s greatest achievement was</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.310" end="00:29:05.210" style="s2">marrying you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.710" end="00:29:08.010" style="s2">Yet he&#39;s just like that deadbeat father.</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.210" end="00:29:08.010" style="s2">Ungrateful fool.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.410" end="00:29:12.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother,</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.410" end="00:29:15.510" style="s2">they chose ruin. They want to be trash.</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.110" end="00:29:17.610" style="s2">We can&#39;t stop them, nor should we.</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.510" end="00:29:20.110" style="s2">Without money to prop them up, they</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.610" end="00:29:22.510" style="s2">won&#39;t enjoy long.</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.110" end="00:29:23.710" style="s2">Let them enjoy their last days.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.510" end="00:29:25.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right.</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.710" end="00:29:27.310" style="s2">What does blood relation matter</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.710" end="00:29:29.710" style="s2">or a marriage bond?</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.310" end="00:29:31.210" style="s2">In the end, money&#39;s more real.</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.710" end="00:29:32.410" style="s2">Living it up every day can&#39;t last</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.210" end="00:29:35.510" style="s2">forever.</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.410" end="00:29:37.310" style="s2">We still need a way to make a living.</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.510" end="00:29:40.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s why I came south.</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.310" end="00:29:44.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought so too. Tomorrow, Crestwood.</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.910" end="00:29:47.010" style="s2">Busy streets, traders abound. With our</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.010" end="00:29:49.110" style="s2">wits and our own hands, we can still</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.010" end="00:29:52.010" style="s2">thrive.</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.110" end="00:29:52.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My good girl.</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.810" end="00:29:59.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ladies, please come in.</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.310" end="00:30:00.910" style="s2">Looking for embroidered pieces or some</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.410" end="00:30:02.910" style="s2">fine silk thread?</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.910" end="00:30:05.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need to fuss, shopkeeper. My</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.910" end="00:30:07.210" style="s2">mother-in-law and I left the capital.</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.010" end="00:30:09.810" style="s2">We&#39;re passing through Crestwood. We hear</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.210" end="00:30:12.410" style="s2">its embroidery is unmatched. We came to</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.810" end="00:30:14.310" style="s2">see it. Sorry to intrude.</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.410" end="00:30:17.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not at all. Not at all.</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.310" end="00:30:20.710" style="s2">Please take your time looking around. If</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.210" end="00:30:21.610" style="s2">you need anything, just call for me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.710" end="00:30:24.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss,</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.610" end="00:30:26.510" style="s2">your needlework is exquisite.</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.210" end="00:30:28.910" style="s2">Every stitch is spaced just right.</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.510" end="00:30:31.710" style="s2">I&#39;ve tried the coiled stitch myself, but</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.910" end="00:30:34.410" style="s2">never got the pressure right.</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.710" end="00:30:37.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re too kind. It&#39;s Hunan&#39;s blended</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.410" end="00:30:39.912" style="s2">stitch. Stitches must cross even</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.112" end="00:30:43.312" style="s2">pressure. The stitches must stay hidden</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.912" end="00:30:45.512" style="s2">and the colors blend naturally.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.312" end="00:30:47.612" style="s2">From your bearing, ma&#39;am, I can tell you</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.512" end="00:30:49.912" style="s2">know embroidery. Why not show us your</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.612" end="00:30:51.212" style="s2">skill and let us admire it?</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.912" end="00:30:54.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.212" end="00:30:54.712" style="s2">I hope I don&#39;t disappoint.</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.212" end="00:31:06.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow. Is this embroidery from the</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.512" end="00:31:09.312" style="s2">capital?</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.712" end="00:31:11.712" style="s2">Those stitches, those colors.</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.312" end="00:31:13.612" style="s2">Even the palace embroiderers might not</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.712" end="00:31:17.012" style="s2">be this skilled.</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.612" end="00:31:17.012" style="s2">Such masterful work.</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.712" end="00:31:21.312" style="s2">Your embroidery is exquisite. We can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.012" end="00:31:23.412" style="s2">compare.</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.312" end="00:31:25.412" style="s2">Please take us as your pupils.</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.412" end="00:31:28.212" style="s2">We&#39;ll serve you faithfully.</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.412" end="00:31:28.212" style="s2">Ask and learn.</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.512" end="00:31:34.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, no. I&#39;m not worthy, not at all.</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.112" end="00:31:36.412" style="s2">I just embroider flowers to pass the</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.212" end="00:31:40.012" style="s2">time when I&#39;m free.</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.412" end="00:31:40.012" style="s2">How could I teach you ladies?</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.312" end="00:31:46.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My sisters and I have practiced for</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.012" end="00:31:48.812" style="s2">years, but still don&#39;t get it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.512" end="00:31:51.112" style="s2">Watching you today made it all click.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.812" end="00:31:52.112" style="s2">Please be kind and take me as your</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.112" end="00:31:54.112" style="s2">pupil.</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.112" end="00:31:56.412" style="s2">Even a few pointers would do.</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.112" end="00:32:00.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right, madam. If you just guide</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.412" end="00:32:02.612" style="s2">us a little, we&#39;d learn so much.</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.012" end="00:32:05.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, since you&#39;re so eager, if we get</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.612" end="00:32:09.412" style="s2">the chance, let&#39;s bond over embroidery.</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.512" end="00:32:11.812" style="s2">I have urgent business. I must be off.</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.412" end="00:32:15.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, you love to embroider at the</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.812" end="00:32:18.212" style="s2">manor. Why head back so early today?</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.112" end="00:32:20.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So many styles, but look closely. The</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.212" end="00:32:22.312" style="s2">embroidered clothes are plain.</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.512" end="00:32:23.312" style="s2">I&#39;ll see other embroidered outfits in</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.312" end="00:32:24.712" style="s2">town.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.312" end="00:32:27.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.712" end="00:32:29.812" style="s2">Hey, the patterns that embroiderer has</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.112" end="00:32:32.212" style="s2">on display look unusual. Let&#39;s go take a</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.812" end="00:32:32.212" style="s2">look.</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.113" end="00:32:45.313" style="s2">Mom, since you got back from the</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.813" end="00:32:47.913" style="s2">workshop, you&#39;ve kept sewing. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.313" end="00:32:50.813" style="s2">getting late. Take a break.</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.913" end="00:32:53.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena heard them at the workshop.</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.813" end="00:32:56.713" style="s2">They want me to teach them.</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.613" end="00:32:58.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, your work is superb. No wonder they</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.713" end="00:33:01.113" style="s2">want to learn from you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.313" end="00:33:04.013" style="s2">But don&#39;t worry yourself out, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.113" end="00:33:06.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not sleepy yet. A street embroiderer</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.013" end="00:33:09.413" style="s2">taught me a new stitch, random stitch</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.313" end="00:33:11.713" style="s2">embroidery. It&#39;s fascinating.</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.413" end="00:33:13.313" style="s2">If I can&#39;t get it right tonight,</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.713" end="00:33:15.713" style="s2">I won&#39;t sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.313" end="00:33:18.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last life, mom was the capital&#39;s top</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.713" end="00:33:21.213" style="s2">embroiderer, but my father-in-law</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.713" end="00:33:22.713" style="s2">kept her sewing in a back courtyard.</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.213" end="00:33:24.213" style="s2">That woman Carter even took her</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.713" end="00:33:26.513" style="s2">embroidery to curry favor with the</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.213" end="00:33:29.613" style="s2">capital&#39;s high society ladies.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.513" end="00:33:31.513" style="s2">Now she&#39;s finally free.</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.613" end="00:33:34.313" style="s2">It&#39;s okay, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.513" end="00:33:37.613" style="s2">Stitch as long as you like.</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.313" end="00:33:37.613" style="s2">I&#39;ll stay here with you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.113" end="00:33:46.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Serena, you&#39;re up.</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.913" end="00:33:49.213" style="s2">Look what I spent all night stitching. I</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.213" end="00:33:49.213" style="s2">finally learned it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.913" end="00:33:57.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you&#39;ve worked so hard.</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.813" end="00:34:00.013" style="s2">We&#39;ll open a workshop one day.</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.313" end="00:34:01.713" style="s2">Your embroidery will be famous.</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.013" end="00:34:05.713" style="s2">Everyone will see you&#39;re more than a</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.713" end="00:34:09.313" style="s2">Grant wife. You&#39;re a master embroiderer.</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.713" end="00:34:12.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Serena. With you, I fear nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.313" end="00:34:16.113" style="s2">You handle the books. I&#39;ll embroider.</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.413" end="00:34:16.113" style="s2">We&#39;ll make a name for ourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.313" end="00:34:20.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We settled in Silk River City.</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.913" end="00:34:21.713" style="s2">We chose a riverside home with two</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.413" end="00:34:25.213" style="s2">courtyards</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.713" end="00:34:27.713" style="s2">and bought two storefronts, a silk shop</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.213" end="00:34:30.513" style="s2">and a pastry shop.</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.713" end="00:34:33.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rest easy, ma&#39;am. I&#39;ve sold silk for</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.513" end="00:34:36.913" style="s2">over 20 years. I&#39;ll give the shop my</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.113" end="00:34:40.013" style="s2">full attention. I won&#39;t let you down.</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.913" end="00:34:42.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Manager Smith is an honest man. I trust</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.013" end="00:34:45.014" style="s2">you. Report [music] the accounts and</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.314" end="00:34:46.854" style="s2">stock in and out monthly.</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.014" end="00:34:48.614" style="s2">I&#39;ll stop by now and then to learn</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.854" end="00:34:50.414" style="s2">[music] the trade from you.</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.614" end="00:34:54.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for your trust. I&#39;ll do my</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.414" end="00:34:54.914" style="s2">duty. I&#39;ll make the silk shop thrive.</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.299" end="00:35:01.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.614" end="00:35:04.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just made these pastries.</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.514" end="00:35:04.614" style="s2">Try some, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.914" end="00:35:10.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for helping me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.114" end="00:35:13.514" style="s2">Since my husband died, I&#39;ve raised our</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.114" end="00:35:15.814" style="s2">two kids alone, barely scraping by.</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.514" end="00:35:16.914" style="s2">Without you, my pastry shop would have</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.814" end="00:35:20.514" style="s2">shut down.</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.914" end="00:35:20.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need to thank me, Mrs. Baker.</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.714" end="00:35:25.814" style="s2">Your pastries are sweet and soft.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.314" end="00:35:27.414" style="s2">The flavor lingers. It&#39;s rare. This</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.814" end="00:35:29.514" style="s2">isn&#39;t charity.</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.414" end="00:35:30.714" style="s2">I&#39;m just a businesswoman here to make</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.514" end="00:35:32.914" style="s2">money with you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.714" end="00:35:34.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re so kind, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.914" end="00:35:36.314" style="s2">I&#39;ll never forget.</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.714" end="00:35:38.514" style="s2">I&#39;ll make the pastries with care, run</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.314" end="00:35:40.414" style="s2">the shop well, and earn your trust.</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.514" end="00:35:43.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, if there&#39;s nothing else, you can</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.414" end="00:35:43.914" style="s2">head back, Mrs. Baker.</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.414" end="00:35:50.014" style="s2">Mom, your original stitch work makes the</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.114" end="00:35:52.614" style="s2">flowers and birds look alive. Noble</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.014" end="00:35:55.114" style="s2">women keep sending people to us. Our</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.614" end="00:35:57.214" style="s2">workshop is booked months ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.114" end="00:35:59.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Crestwood&#39;s random stitch embroidery</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.214" end="00:36:03.114" style="s2">blends with traditional embroidery.</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.714" end="00:36:05.814" style="s2">It&#39;s so fresh. I can&#39;t stop stitching.</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.114" end="00:36:09.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on, we&#39;ll stay in this house,</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.814" end="00:36:09.614" style="s2">live in peace, and be free.</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.814" end="00:36:17.814" style="s2">Manager Smith, what has you so happy?</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.414" end="00:36:20.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, I just got back from Green Hills</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.814" end="00:36:22.114" style="s2">with new stock. I heard the strangest</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.114" end="00:36:24.114" style="s2">story about a widowed salt merchant</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.114" end="00:36:26.314" style="s2">named Crawford.</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.114" end="00:36:28.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve had a long trip, Manager Smith.</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.314" end="00:36:30.714" style="s2">Sit and rest a while, then tell us all</p>
<p begin="00:36:28.414" end="00:36:32.614" style="s2">about it. We could use a laugh.</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.714" end="00:36:34.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That widow Crawford comes from a family</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.614" end="00:36:35.814" style="s2">of salt merchants.</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.214" end="00:36:37.714" style="s2">They&#39;re quite wealthy.</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.814" end="00:36:40.314" style="s2">A few years ago, she took in a Whitmore</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.714" end="00:36:43.114" style="s2">father and son as living sons-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.314" end="00:36:44.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, a father and son both marrying in?</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.114" end="00:36:46.416" style="s2">That&#39;s a new one.</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.616" end="00:36:49.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They call them sons in law, but they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.416" end="00:36:51.316" style="s2">servants bound by indenture contracts.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.116" end="00:36:53.716" style="s2">The family ties are just for show, to</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.316" end="00:36:56.116" style="s2">save face. But wouldn&#39;t you know it, the</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.716" end="00:36:58.716" style="s2">two had other plans. They secretly moved</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.116" end="00:37:00.916" style="s2">the Crawford fortune.</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.716" end="00:37:01.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, how long do we have to put up with</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.916" end="00:37:04.116" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.916" end="00:37:06.616" style="s2">We do backbreaking work every day, and</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.116" end="00:37:09.016" style="s2">Amanda won&#39;t even let me into her bed.</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.616" end="00:37:10.716" style="s2">We should escape while we can. Anything</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.016" end="00:37:12.416" style="s2">beats slaving away here.</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.716" end="00:37:14.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the rush?</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.416" end="00:37:16.616" style="s2">If you hadn&#39;t insisted on visiting</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.116" end="00:37:18.916" style="s2">brothels and blown all our travel money,</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.616" end="00:37:21.716" style="s2">we wouldn&#39;t be in this mess.</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.916" end="00:37:23.816" style="s2">I gave up being a general</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.716" end="00:37:25.616" style="s2">to become a servant.</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.816" end="00:37:27.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We haven&#39;t lost everything.</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.616" end="00:37:29.916" style="s2">Mom and Serena are still keeping our</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.316" end="00:37:31.916" style="s2">family afloat.</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.916" end="00:37:33.416" style="s2">Let&#39;s go back to the capital.</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.916" end="00:37:35.716" style="s2">It&#39;s better than living at their mercy.</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.416" end="00:37:38.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t have enough money. We&#39;d starve</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.716" end="00:37:40.516" style="s2">before reaching the capital. Jordan has</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.216" end="00:37:43.316" style="s2">a fortune. I&#39;ll slip something into his</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.516" end="00:37:45.516" style="s2">bedtime tea tonight. By midnight, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.316" end="00:37:47.816" style="s2">have his fortune. Then we&#39;ll return to</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.516" end="00:37:51.216" style="s2">the Whitmore home overnight.</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.816" end="00:37:53.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, dad. Your call.</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.216" end="00:37:55.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those two are acting awfully sneaky.</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.716" end="00:37:58.716" style="s2">What are they whispering about?</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.916" end="00:37:58.716" style="s2">Something&#39;s off.</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.116" end="00:38:08.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hannah, Hannah.</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.816" end="00:38:10.416" style="s2">Umph, that vicious woman hounds us both</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.116" end="00:38:13.916" style="s2">all day.</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.416" end="00:38:13.916" style="s2">Then I won&#39;t play nice today.</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.716" end="00:38:23.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What on earth is Victor up to?</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.616" end="00:38:25.716" style="s2">Think the Crawfords are fools. You can</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.016" end="00:38:25.716" style="s2">fool us.</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.116" end="00:38:33.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, did you find the money?</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.716" end="00:38:36.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I found it. I found it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.516" end="00:38:39.916" style="s2">That old hag hid all this cash. Umph,</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.716" end="00:38:41.516" style="s2">she said her in-laws took all her money.</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.916" end="00:38:44.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is great.</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.516" end="00:38:44.516" style="s2">Dad, we&#39;re rich.</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.716" end="00:38:50.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No time to waste. Pack it up and let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.517" end="00:38:50.717" style="s2">go. Before that old hag catches us.</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.417" end="00:38:59.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, well.</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.217" end="00:39:00.917" style="s2">I watched day and night, yet thieves</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.017" end="00:39:02.217" style="s2">were under my roof.</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.917" end="00:39:03.617" style="s2">Victor.</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.217" end="00:39:05.817" style="s2">Julian.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.617" end="00:39:09.817" style="s2">You&#39;ve got some nerve.</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.817" end="00:39:09.817" style="s2">Stealing money right under my nose.</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.817" end="00:39:17.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hannah, it&#39;s not what you think.</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.117" end="00:39:19.117" style="s2">Just hear me out. It&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.617" end="00:39:23.017" style="s2">misunderstanding.</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.117" end="00:39:27.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Caught red-handed and you still deny it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.017" end="00:39:27.017" style="s2">Someone beat these two thieves.</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.117" end="00:39:33.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hannah, stop.</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.717" end="00:39:34.317" style="s2">I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.017" end="00:39:37.017" style="s2">Please forgive me.</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.317" end="00:39:37.017" style="s2">I lost my head.</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.217" end="00:39:41.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amanda, I was wrong. Please forgive me</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.717" end="00:39:43.817" style="s2">just this once.</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.717" end="00:39:45.917" style="s2">I&#39;ll kneel before you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.817" end="00:39:47.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ugh, I must have been blind to fall for</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.917" end="00:39:49.717" style="s2">someone like you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.617" end="00:39:52.017" style="s2">Aunt Hannah, call the law.</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.717" end="00:39:54.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, call the law.</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.017" end="00:39:55.517" style="s2">We don&#39;t know who these two are and</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.117" end="00:39:57.417" style="s2">they&#39;re thieves.</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.517" end="00:40:00.217" style="s2">They&#39;re perverts too.</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.417" end="00:40:01.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, don&#39;t call them. Hannah, please</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.217" end="00:40:03.417" style="s2">don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.317" end="00:40:04.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two crooks.</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.417" end="00:40:06.917" style="s2">I took you in because you were</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.917" end="00:40:07.717" style="s2">good-looking and this is how you repay</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.917" end="00:40:09.517" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.717" end="00:40:10.517" style="s2">I&#39;ll call the law and run you out of</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.517" end="00:40:13.717" style="s2">Green Hills.</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.517" end="00:40:16.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Hannah. Don&#39;t call them. I&#39;m Victor</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.717" end="00:40:18.117" style="s2">Vance, a sixth-rank military officer</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.017" end="00:40:20.817" style="s2">from the capital.</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.117" end="00:40:24.017" style="s2">I&#39;m not lying to you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.817" end="00:40:25.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A sixth-rank officer? Impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.017" end="00:40:27.617" style="s2">If you&#39;re a high official, how did you</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.717" end="00:40:29.717" style="s2">end up like this?</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.617" end="00:40:31.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a long story. Enemies at court</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.717" end="00:40:34.017" style="s2">plotted against me.</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.317" end="00:40:36.117" style="s2">I nearly died on the battlefield.</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.017" end="00:40:38.717" style="s2">Luckily, Julian fought our way out at</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.117" end="00:40:40.117" style="s2">the last moment and we</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.717" end="00:40:41.217" style="s2">both escaped.</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.117" end="00:40:43.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.217" end="00:40:45.717" style="s2">My father is a court official.</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.517" end="00:40:49.117" style="s2">He&#39;s only down on his luck.</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.717" end="00:40:49.318" style="s2">Once we return, he&#39;ll get his post back.</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.117" end="00:40:52.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.318" end="00:40:55.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hannah, this badge looks real.</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.618" end="00:40:58.918" style="s2">Then why didn&#39;t you tell us who you were</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.618" end="00:41:00.418" style="s2">before marrying into our family?</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.918" end="00:41:02.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I outshone the ruler and made many</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.418" end="00:41:05.318" style="s2">enemies at court.</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.318" end="00:41:08.118" style="s2">My son and I can&#39;t return openly.</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.318" end="00:41:11.918" style="s2">Our enemies might kill us, so we hid who</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.118" end="00:41:11.918" style="s2">we were until it&#39;s safe to return.</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.018" end="00:41:17.718" style="s2">Hannah, don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.918" end="00:41:19.718" style="s2">I may be down on my luck, but I own</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.718" end="00:41:22.218" style="s2">16,000 acres near the capital and</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.718" end="00:41:24.118" style="s2">countless jewels and riches. Marry me</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.218" end="00:41:27.618" style="s2">and bring your family fortune, and</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.118" end="00:41:27.618" style="s2">you&#39;ll live in luxury forever.</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.518" end="00:41:34.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You may leave us.</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.818" end="00:41:39.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amanda, I&#39;m the only son of the Vance</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.518" end="00:41:41.718" style="s2">family in the capital. I&#39;ll inherit</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.618" end="00:41:44.018" style="s2">everything. Marry me, and you&#39;ll join</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.718" end="00:41:46.218" style="s2">the capital&#39;s noble ladies. You want for</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.018" end="00:41:48.218" style="s2">nothing. You&#39;ll have status.</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.218" end="00:41:50.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really, Julian?</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.218" end="00:41:52.118" style="s2">Do you truly love me that much?</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.218" end="00:41:53.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My love for you is true.</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.118" end="00:41:55.318" style="s2">Heaven knows it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.418" end="00:41:57.018" style="s2">If I ever betray you, Amanda, may</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.318" end="00:41:57.918" style="s2">lightning strike me and may I die</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.018" end="00:42:00.918" style="s2">horribly.</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.918" end="00:42:02.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t say that. Julian, I believe you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.918" end="00:42:04.518" style="s2">Victor,</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.018" end="00:42:06.618" style="s2">I&#39;m carrying your child.</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.518" end="00:42:09.218" style="s2">I meant to tell you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.618" end="00:42:11.118" style="s2">I never thought you&#39;d do this.</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.218" end="00:42:13.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s wonderful, Hannah.</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.118" end="00:42:14.518" style="s2">I was a fool. Hit me, curse me, whatever</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.318" end="00:42:15.318" style="s2">you want.</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.518" end="00:42:17.518" style="s2">Just forgive me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.318" end="00:42:20.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For the child&#39;s sake, I&#39;ll trust you one</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.518" end="00:42:22.618" style="s2">last time. I can overlook your past.</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.718" end="00:42:24.618" style="s2">But you must observe the six etiquettes.</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.618" end="00:42:25.718" style="s2">Dress me in the bridal coronet and robe</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.618" end="00:42:28.118" style="s2">and marry me properly.</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.718" end="00:42:30.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That old hag is insatiable,</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.118" end="00:42:32.118" style="s2">demanding this and that.</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.118" end="00:42:34.618" style="s2">She&#39;ll make a fool of herself.</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.118" end="00:42:37.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Having second thoughts?</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.618" end="00:42:39.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not, Hannah. If you hadn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.118" end="00:42:42.018" style="s2">taken me in, my son and I might not be</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.518" end="00:42:44.718" style="s2">alive today. Of course I want to marry</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.018" end="00:42:47.318" style="s2">you and give our child a rightful place.</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.718" end="00:42:51.318" style="s2">It&#39;s just that I can&#39;t afford it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.318" end="00:42:51.318" style="s2">Amanda, talk to your aunt for me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.518" end="00:42:57.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie, seize your chance.</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.820" end="00:42:59.720" style="s2">If we help them when they need it most,</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.120" end="00:43:02.720" style="s2">won&#39;t they be grateful to us for years?</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.720" end="00:43:05.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amanda, take it from your aunt. Nine</p>
<p begin="00:43:02.720" end="00:43:08.220" style="s2">times out of 10 men lie. And we don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.920" end="00:43:09.920" style="s2">even know if that token is real.</p>
<p begin="00:43:08.220" end="00:43:12.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His love might be fake, but the money&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.920" end="00:43:13.820" style="s2">real, right? He promised to marry you</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.020" end="00:43:15.420" style="s2">with an eight-seater sedan share. If</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.820" end="00:43:17.620" style="s2">he&#39;s an imposter, would he dare make</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.420" end="00:43:21.220" style="s2">such a public return?</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.620" end="00:43:24.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, fine. If it means a good life later,</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.220" end="00:43:26.220" style="s2">I&#39;ll call this money an investment. Once</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.020" end="00:43:29.620" style="s2">I&#39;m the lady of the house, who&#39;ll dare</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.220" end="00:43:32.020" style="s2">call me an unwanted widow?</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.620" end="00:43:34.420" style="s2">Victor, you&#39;ve suffered lately. Here&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.020" end="00:43:37.120" style="s2">an idea. I&#39;ll lend you my dowry for a</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.420" end="00:43:39.320" style="s2">bridal coronet and robe. We&#39;ll return to</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.120" end="00:43:41.120" style="s2">the capital in style. That will stop</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.320" end="00:43:42.220" style="s2">those schemers hiding in the shadows</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.120" end="00:43:44.620" style="s2">from making a move.</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.220" end="00:43:46.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dear Hannah, you&#39;re such a good wife. I</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.620" end="00:43:49.220" style="s2">won&#39;t let you down.</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.720" end="00:43:51.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That father and son. Dad claims he&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.220" end="00:43:53.720" style="s2">capital official who&#39;ll take Widow</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.220" end="00:43:56.320" style="s2">Crawford home to live in luxury.</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.720" end="00:43:58.120" style="s2">Ha, assault merchant&#39;s widow snagged a</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.320" end="00:43:59.920" style="s2">top official.</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.120" end="00:44:01.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, let&#39;s go watch the drama in the</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.920" end="00:44:01.920" style="s2">capital.</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.220" end="00:44:04.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.920" end="00:44:06.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Manager Smith, I need a favor. That</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.820" end="00:44:08.920" style="s2">father and son&#39;s mess with Widow</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.620" end="00:44:11.820" style="s2">Crawford in Green Hills. Spread the</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.920" end="00:44:15.420" style="s2">word. The farther, the better. Looks</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.820" end="00:44:15.420" style="s2">like the real show&#39;s about to begin.</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.320" end="00:44:27.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three years and you both look just the</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.920" end="00:44:30.020" style="s2">same. You haven&#39;t aged a day. Here for</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.320" end="00:44:32.920" style="s2">the wedding procession, too?</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.020" end="00:44:34.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ages since I visited the capital. I</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.920" end="00:44:37.120" style="s2">didn&#39;t expect such a crowd.</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.920" end="00:44:39.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your business is booming, too. Thanks to</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.120" end="00:44:39.320" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.420" end="00:44:43.220" style="s2">If you hadn&#39;t been so kind and sold me</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.920" end="00:44:45.620" style="s2">the shop,</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.220" end="00:44:48.520" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t run it like this. Fine dragon</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.620" end="00:44:50.820" style="s2">wealthy is my thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.520" end="00:44:52.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, shopkeeper.</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.820" end="00:44:55.321" style="s2">With this wedding parade,</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.720" end="00:44:57.321" style="s2">you You be making a killing today.</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.321" end="00:44:59.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s hope so.</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.321" end="00:45:02.821" style="s2">Strange thing is,</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.721" end="00:45:04.821" style="s2">I hear Vance Manor is hosting a wedding,</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.821" end="00:45:07.621" style="s2">but all along this street, there&#39;s no</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.821" end="00:45:07.621" style="s2">Vance Manor.</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.821" end="00:45:12.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.421" end="00:45:14.921" style="s2">The capital&#39;s Vance Manor</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.421" end="00:45:17.021" style="s2">was gone three years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.921" end="00:45:20.021" style="s2">Let&#39;s see how they&#39;ll cover up this</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.021" end="00:45:20.021" style="s2">colossal lie.</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.621" end="00:45:27.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch what&#39;s going on.</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.821" end="00:45:27.121" style="s2">This should be Vance Manor.</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.121" end="00:45:34.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, why Chen Manor?</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.321" end="00:45:35.721" style="s2">We left just three years ago. How did</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.221" end="00:45:37.721" style="s2">change so much?</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.721" end="00:45:40.121" style="s2">Did we come to the wrong place?</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.721" end="00:45:44.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve lived here for decades. How could I</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.121" end="00:45:47.521" style="s2">forget my way home? This is my house.</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.521" end="00:45:47.521" style="s2">Let&#39;s go inside.</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.321" end="00:45:53.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.721" end="00:45:54.721" style="s2">How dare you enter Chen Manor?</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.721" end="00:45:56.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want to die?</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.721" end="00:45:58.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you?</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.121" end="00:45:59.121" style="s2">This is Vance Manor. I&#39;m Evelyn Vance&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.021" end="00:46:01.221" style="s2">husband.</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.121" end="00:46:02.221" style="s2">Bring Evelyn Vance out here.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.221" end="00:46:04.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vance?</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.221" end="00:46:06.221" style="s2">I&#39;ve lived here for three years.</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.521" end="00:46:08.021" style="s2">Never heard of any Vances or anyone</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.221" end="00:46:09.921" style="s2">named Evelyn Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.021" end="00:46:12.621" style="s2">Our master is out today.</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.921" end="00:46:15.821" style="s2">If it&#39;s urgent, show your visiting card.</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.621" end="00:46:15.821" style="s2">Otherwise, move along.</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.421" end="00:46:19.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.021" end="00:46:25.721" style="s2">Snobby guard dogs, all of you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.821" end="00:46:30.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, sure this is the place.</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.121" end="00:46:32.521" style="s2">If we wait any longer, we&#39;ll miss the</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.821" end="00:46:34.921" style="s2">wedding hour.</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.521" end="00:46:37.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor Vance, [music] did you lie to me?</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.921" end="00:46:40.721" style="s2">That plaque clearly says Chen Manor.</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.221" end="00:46:40.721" style="s2">Where&#39;s Vance Manor in any of this?</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.121" end="00:46:46.321" style="s2">Victor, are you lying to me? The sign on</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.921" end="00:46:47.721" style="s2">the gate clearly says Chen Manor.</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.321" end="00:46:49.321" style="s2">Where&#39;s Vance Manor?</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.721" end="00:46:51.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t that Widow Crawford from Green</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.321" end="00:46:52.921" style="s2">Hills? How&#39;d she get married in the</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.121" end="00:46:55.321" style="s2">capital? What fool would send an</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.921" end="00:46:57.422" style="s2">eight-seater sedan chair for a widow?</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.321" end="00:46:59.922" style="s2">Huh, bet she got swindled and thanked</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.422" end="00:46:59.922" style="s2">them for it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.223" end="00:47:04.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian, what the hell is going on?</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.523" end="00:47:10.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our home is right here.</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.823" end="00:47:13.422" style="s2">See that shop? My mom runs it. It brings</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.723" end="00:47:15.023" style="s2">in at least $2,200 a year.</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.422" end="00:47:16.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hannah, the silk shop down the street</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.023" end="00:47:18.922" style="s2">belongs to Vance Manor.</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.922" end="00:47:20.622" style="s2">We&#39;ve been gone three years.</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.922" end="00:47:21.523" style="s2">Things may have changed, but the shop&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:47:20.622" end="00:47:23.323" style="s2">still ours.</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.523" end="00:47:24.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena&#39;s silk shop?</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.323" end="00:47:25.922" style="s2">There&#39;s only a spring breeze pavilion</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.823" end="00:47:27.823" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.922" end="00:47:29.622" style="s2">What silk shop?</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.823" end="00:47:31.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can this be?</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.622" end="00:47:34.823" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry. Maybe the shop has a new</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.922" end="00:47:37.622" style="s2">owner. I&#39;ll find out what happened.</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.823" end="00:47:39.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, let&#39;s go down and watch the show.</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.622" end="00:47:41.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, Serena. It&#39;s time those</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.723" end="00:47:44.122" style="s2">ungrateful wolves got what&#39;s coming to</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.823" end="00:47:44.122" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.223" end="00:47:51.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey Dad, look. Mom&#39;s back.</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.523" end="00:47:57.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, look. Mom&#39;s back.</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.823" end="00:47:58.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn, how have you run this house?</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.223" end="00:47:59.523" style="s2">Where did you move my entire Vance</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.823" end="00:48:01.323" style="s2">Manor?</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.523" end="00:48:03.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re still alive?</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.323" end="00:48:05.023" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you die in battle years ago?</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.122" end="00:48:07.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In that battle, if Hannah hadn&#39;t saved</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.023" end="00:48:09.122" style="s2">me and cared for me day and night, I</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.023" end="00:48:10.922" style="s2">might not have made it home alive. Now</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.122" end="00:48:13.523" style="s2">that I&#39;ve returned safely, why aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.922" end="00:48:15.523" style="s2">you happy to see me? Enough. Now that</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.523" end="00:48:17.523" style="s2">Hannah and I are home, you&#39;ve led this</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.523" end="00:48:20.223" style="s2">house for years. It&#39;s time you stepped</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.523" end="00:48:20.223" style="s2">aside for her.</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.723" end="00:48:24.823" style="s2">Behave, and I&#39;ll take you as my</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.422" end="00:48:26.523" style="s2">concubine.</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.823" end="00:48:30.523" style="s2">For old time&#39;s sake,</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.523" end="00:48:30.523" style="s2">I&#39;ll still let you stay at Vance Manor.</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.223" end="00:48:36.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is this insolent fool?</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.922" end="00:48:38.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; General Vance died for his country</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.422" end="00:48:39.823" style="s2">three years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.223" end="00:48:42.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You, a general?</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.823" end="00:48:42.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.223" end="00:48:46.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, gone mad? Don&#39;t you know your</p>
<p begin="00:48:44.622" end="00:48:48.323" style="s2">father-in-law?</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.323" end="00:48:51.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, yes.</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.323" end="00:48:55.723" style="s2">Hm. Your two lifeless faces, even as</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.622" end="00:48:55.723" style="s2">ashes, I&#39;d never forget them.</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.723" end="00:49:02.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m your husband. How dare you hit me?</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.824" end="00:49:05.568" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Husband? My husband died in battle three</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.324" end="00:49:07.024" style="s2">years ago. Quit messing with me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.568" end="00:49:10.824" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.024" end="00:49:10.824" style="s2">Guards, throw them all out.</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.924" end="00:49:19.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop. Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.124" end="00:49:21.824" style="s2">Serena, this is the peace jade pendant</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.024" end="00:49:24.624" style="s2">you prayed for when I went to war.</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.824" end="00:49:27.024" style="s2">I know you&#39;re angry I was gone so long.</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.624" end="00:49:30.024" style="s2">But you can&#39;t say things like that.</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.024" end="00:49:32.424" style="s2">Serena, it&#39;s my father&#39;s wedding day. I</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.024" end="00:49:33.824" style="s2">came back in a rush. Let us into Vance</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.424" end="00:49:36.724" style="s2">manor first.</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.824" end="00:49:39.224" style="s2">We can talk everything over later.</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.724" end="00:49:42.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In my last life, I feared he&#39;d die at</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.224" end="00:49:44.224" style="s2">war. I offered 10 years of my life so</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.124" end="00:49:46.724" style="s2">he&#39;d come home safe.</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.224" end="00:49:49.524" style="s2">Looking back, what a joke.</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.724" end="00:49:53.724" style="s2">My husband never believed in gods.</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.524" end="00:49:53.724" style="s2">Why would he wear a peace jade pendant?</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.724" end="00:50:00.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are these two mad? The general&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.124" end="00:50:03.224" style="s2">funeral was three years ago. They dare</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.624" end="00:50:04.724" style="s2">pose as a high official? That could cost</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.224" end="00:50:06.524" style="s2">them their heads.</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.724" end="00:50:08.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, I&#39;ve seen it all.</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.524" end="00:50:09.224" style="s2">These ladies don&#39;t know this father and</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.124" end="00:50:10.724" style="s2">son.</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.224" end="00:50:12.124" style="s2">Did they see two distinguished ladies</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.724" end="00:50:15.324" style="s2">and try to hit on them?</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.124" end="00:50:17.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, look at me. I&#39;m your son.</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.324" end="00:50:19.324" style="s2">You can&#39;t just abandon me. I was only</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.624" end="00:50:21.024" style="s2">gone three years.</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.324" end="00:50:22.924" style="s2">Why are you all pretending not to know</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.024" end="00:50:24.224" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.924" end="00:50:26.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My son</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.224" end="00:50:28.824" style="s2">died for his country three years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.224" end="00:50:30.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I really am your son.</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.824" end="00:50:31.824" style="s2">You never hit me growing up. Why hit me</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.724" end="00:50:33.524" style="s2">the moment we meet?</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.824" end="00:50:35.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got off easy.</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.524" end="00:50:37.624" style="s2">Julian was a devoted son. Yet you come</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.924" end="00:50:39.824" style="s2">back without asking after his mother or</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.624" end="00:50:41.324" style="s2">his family&#39;s sworn guards, but parade a</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.824" end="00:50:43.324" style="s2">woman through town.</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.324" end="00:50:46.424" style="s2">How dare you claim to be her son?</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.324" end="00:50:47.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have no son like you. Guards, give</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.424" end="00:50:49.524" style="s2">these scoundrels a good beating and</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.924" end="00:50:52.224" style="s2">throw them out.</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.524" end="00:50:54.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I I didn&#39;t mean it like that.</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.224" end="00:50:55.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, old madam, calm down. You can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.224" end="00:50:56.324" style="s2">beat us.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.324" end="00:50:58.324" style="s2">My aunt is pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.324" end="00:51:00.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, even if you pretend not to know</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.324" end="00:51:02.425" style="s2">us and won&#39;t let us back into the manor,</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.424" end="00:51:05.525" style="s2">I&#39;m still carrying a Vance child. How</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.425" end="00:51:07.625" style="s2">can you be so cruel?</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.525" end="00:51:09.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whose wife am I supposed to be? And</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.625" end="00:51:13.725" style="s2">whose mistress are you?</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.825" end="00:51:13.725" style="s2">Why should I care about Vance heirs?</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.525" end="00:51:18.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When the Vance men died in battle, I had</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.425" end="00:51:20.325" style="s2">them removed from the registry, sold off</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.425" end="00:51:22.525" style="s2">all the family property, and cut all</p>
<p begin="00:51:20.325" end="00:51:23.925" style="s2">ties with the Vances. How dare you use a</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.525" end="00:51:26.925" style="s2">child to threaten my mother?</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.925" end="00:51:28.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say, you vicious woman?</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.925" end="00:51:29.525" style="s2">You sold the estate I spent decades</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.725" end="00:51:32.025" style="s2">building?</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.525" end="00:51:33.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not all. With you and Julian gone</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.025" end="00:51:35.525" style="s2">for good, I was kind enough to [music]</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.625" end="00:51:38.725" style="s2">sell off all three secondary wives and</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.525" end="00:51:40.325" style="s2">concubines. They fetched $8,000 in all.</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.725" end="00:51:42.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 8,000?</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.325" end="00:51:44.925" style="s2">Serena, has greed driven you mad? How</p>
<p begin="00:51:42.825" end="00:51:46.625" style="s2">could you do something so vile?</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.925" end="00:51:50.025" style="s2">As your husband,</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.625" end="00:51:50.025" style="s2">I&#39;ll teach you a lesson today.</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.925" end="00:51:55.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.625" end="00:51:58.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.725" end="00:51:59.225" style="s2">Who dares touch me when they see this</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.125" end="00:52:02.925" style="s2">badge?</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.225" end="00:52:05.125" style="s2">I&#39;m a sixth rank military officer.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.925" end="00:52:07.925" style="s2">Everything the Vances own is mine. You</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.125" end="00:52:11.725" style="s2">have no right to take it, outsider.</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.925" end="00:52:11.725" style="s2">And you dared strike my rightful heir?</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.125" end="00:52:18.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, they&#39;re so desperate to get the</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.225" end="00:52:20.025" style="s2">estate back, they&#39;ve even exposed</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.325" end="00:52:22.225" style="s2">themselves as deserters.</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.025" end="00:52:24.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s exactly what I was waiting for.</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.225" end="00:52:27.125" style="s2">He thinks reclaiming his identity solves</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.325" end="00:52:28.425" style="s2">everything. This time, it&#39;ll blow up in</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.125" end="00:52:30.325" style="s2">his face.</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.425" end="00:52:31.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, you&#39;re my daughter-in-law, yet</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.325" end="00:52:33.425" style="s2">you disrespect your elders and defy your</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.925" end="00:52:35.325" style="s2">husband&#39;s family. With both our</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.425" end="00:52:36.425" style="s2">identities established, how dare you lie</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.325" end="00:52:38.325" style="s2">about us?</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.425" end="00:52:40.425" style="s2">If you know what&#39;s good for you, step</p>
<p begin="00:52:38.325" end="00:52:42.725" style="s2">down as head of this house and hand over</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.425" end="00:52:45.825" style="s2">all the Vance property, or I&#39;ll punish</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.725" end="00:52:47.425" style="s2">you under family law.</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.825" end="00:52:48.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what if I say no?</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.425" end="00:52:50.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You dare say no?</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.525" end="00:52:51.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lord, if she won&#39;t listen to reason,</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.625" end="00:52:53.725" style="s2">put the woman who tried to kill her</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.925" end="00:52:56.025" style="s2">husband and defied her elders in a pig</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.725" end="00:52:56.725" style="s2">basket and drown her. Uphold our family</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.025" end="00:52:58.025" style="s2">rules.</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.725" end="00:52:59.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.025" end="00:53:01.225" style="s2">I&#39;ve been gone three years.</p>
<p begin="00:52:59.925" end="00:53:02.925" style="s2">Who knows how many men that wretch</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.225" end="00:53:04.025" style="s2">Serena has kept on the side behind my</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.925" end="00:53:07.227" style="s2">back?</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.025" end="00:53:07.227" style="s2">She needs be taught a lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.227" end="00:53:13.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you punish me, you&#39;d better think</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.427" end="00:53:16.027" style="s2">hard about whether you can face the</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.127" end="00:53:16.027" style="s2">consequences.</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.427" end="00:53:20.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.227" end="00:53:21.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurry up and deal with that wretch</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.627" end="00:53:24.927" style="s2">Serena.</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.627" end="00:53:25.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, you you actually</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.927" end="00:53:28.227" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.727" end="00:53:29.727" style="s2">We&#39;ll discuss this another day.</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.227" end="00:53:31.927" style="s2">I&#39;ll let you go for now.</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.727" end="00:53:34.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, have you lost your mind? Why not</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.927" end="00:53:36.227" style="s2">execute that vicious woman right here?</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.327" end="00:53:37.527" style="s2">The entire general&#39;s estate belongs to</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.227" end="00:53:39.227" style="s2">the Vances.</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.527" end="00:53:40.527" style="s2">Serena is just an orphan with no</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.227" end="00:53:43.727" style="s2">parents.</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.527" end="00:53:45.827" style="s2">What right has she to sell our property?</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.727" end="00:53:47.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut your mouth. Haven&#39;t you shamed us</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.827" end="00:53:49.327" style="s2">enough?</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.327" end="00:53:50.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you both forgotten that three years</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.327" end="00:53:52.727" style="s2">ago</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.727" end="00:53:53.827" style="s2">you left here under what identities what</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.727" end="00:53:55.527" style="s2">identities?</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.827" end="00:53:55.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor, are you hiding something from</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.527" end="00:53:56.727" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.827" end="00:53:57.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ahem.</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.727" end="00:54:00.327" style="s2">Uh</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.727" end="00:54:01.727" style="s2">Hannah, this is Vance family business.</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.327" end="00:54:03.427" style="s2">You&#39;re pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.727" end="00:54:06.027" style="s2">Don&#39;t upset yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.427" end="00:54:07.527" style="s2">Amanda, take your aunt outside to wait.</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.027" end="00:54:09.727" style="s2">I have important matters to discuss with</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.527" end="00:54:09.727" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.527" end="00:54:16.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, we just acted in anger.</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.927" end="00:54:19.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh.</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.927" end="00:54:21.027" style="s2">You must be losing your mind.</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.327" end="00:54:23.127" style="s2">Who pulled out a badge just now and</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.027" end="00:54:25.327" style="s2">swore he was General Vance with a</p>
<p begin="00:54:23.127" end="00:54:27.527" style="s2">legitimate Vance heir?</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.327" end="00:54:28.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Would you really stand by and let Julian</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.527" end="00:54:31.327" style="s2">die?</p>
<p begin="00:54:28.927" end="00:54:34.827" style="s2">If he dies, you&#39;ll be a widow. Think</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.327" end="00:54:34.827" style="s2">what people will say about you.</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.027" end="00:54:39.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad&#39;s all bark and no bite. He always</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.627" end="00:54:41.727" style="s2">did what I said at home.</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.527" end="00:54:42.227" style="s2">He wouldn&#39;t dare. Don&#39;t let him scare</p>
<p begin="00:54:41.727" end="00:54:43.527" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.227" end="00:54:46.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.527" end="00:54:48.127" style="s2">Kneel and apologize to Serena now. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.127" end="00:54:51.027" style="s2">your only chance to live.</p>
<p begin="00:54:48.127" end="00:54:54.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, my son and I were fools before.</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.027" end="00:54:55.127" style="s2">Show us some mercy. Let us live.</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.127" end="00:54:57.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mercy?</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.127" end="00:54:59.327" style="s2">When you two died in battle, His Majesty</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.427" end="00:55:00.427" style="s2">didn&#39;t punish you for losing White River</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.327" end="00:55:02.127" style="s2">Crossing.</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.427" end="00:55:04.127" style="s2">Dead men have it easy.</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.127" end="00:55:06.727" style="s2">Living men don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.127" end="00:55:09.128" style="s2">Now you&#39;ve come back unharmed. Admitting</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.727" end="00:55:11.828" style="s2">in public your advances is admitting</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.128" end="00:55:13.728" style="s2">your deserters.</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.828" end="00:55:15.728" style="s2">Under Liang Law,</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.728" end="00:55:19.128" style="s2">that&#39;s treason.</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.728" end="00:55:19.128" style="s2">All nine clans die.</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.428" end="00:55:23.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What treason? I only faked my death.</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.428" end="00:55:26.428" style="s2">I didn&#39;t desert.</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.928" end="00:55:27.328" style="s2">I didn&#39;t betray the crown.</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.428" end="00:55:28.528" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.328" end="00:55:30.928" style="s2">That&#39;s impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.528" end="00:55:35.128" style="s2">I don&#39;t believe it.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.928" end="00:55:35.128" style="s2">You did this, Serena, you vicious woman.</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.328" end="00:55:39.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian,</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.428" end="00:55:42.028" style="s2">Victor, you lost White River Crossing.</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.728" end="00:55:45.128" style="s2">And you dare come back? Don&#39;t expect to</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.028" end="00:55:45.128" style="s2">leave here alive.</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.228" end="00:55:50.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no.</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.028" end="00:55:51.228" style="s2">I&#39;m not Victor Vance. I&#39;m not a general.</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.228" end="00:55:53.628" style="s2">Ha ha ha.</p>
<p begin="00:55:51.228" end="00:55:54.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor, do you regret it now?</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.628" end="00:55:57.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Um</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.728" end="00:56:00.828" style="s2">Evelyn, you wouldn&#39;t dare touch us.</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.128" end="00:56:00.828" style="s2">Would you watch your only son die?</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.128" end="00:56:05.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Die?</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.328" end="00:56:07.928" style="s2">I won&#39;t let you die so easily.</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.028" end="00:56:10.628" style="s2">I&#39;ll make you see this.</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.928" end="00:56:11.928" style="s2">Life hurts a thousand times more.</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.628" end="00:56:14.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This day,</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.928" end="00:56:18.128" style="s2">Victor Vance won&#39;t forget.</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.128" end="00:56:18.128" style="s2">One day, I&#39;ll make you pay.</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.128" end="00:56:23.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well,</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.228" end="00:56:25.128" style="s2">did that wretch hand over the family</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.728" end="00:56:27.928" style="s2">fortune?</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.128" end="00:56:30.528" style="s2">Can I move into Vance Manor now?</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.928" end="00:56:32.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can&#39;t tell them we&#39;re deserters,</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.528" end="00:56:35.328" style="s2">or we&#39;ll lose our golden goose. They</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.828" end="00:56:38.179" style="s2">were prepared. We gained nothing this</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.328" end="00:56:39.728" style="s2">time and took a huge loss.</p>
<p begin="00:56:38.179" end="00:56:42.028" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.728" end="00:56:44.074" style="s2">Let&#39;s find somewhere to stay first, then</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.028" end="00:56:44.928" style="s2">plan our next move.</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.074" end="00:56:47.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.928" end="00:56:50.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I came all this way to marry you</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.728" end="00:56:52.528" style="s2">and got none of the good life.</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.028" end="00:56:56.328" style="s2">Now nearly all my travel money&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.528" end="00:56:57.828" style="s2">Victor, are you even a man?</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.328" end="00:57:01.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hannah,</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.828" end="00:57:02.728" style="s2">I&#39;ve put you through a lot lately.</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.128" end="00:57:04.328" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.728" end="00:57:05.828" style="s2">I have many former colleagues in the</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.328" end="00:57:07.928" style="s2">capital.</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.828" end="00:57:09.528" style="s2">Julian and I will ask a few to help us</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.928" end="00:57:10.529" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.528" end="00:57:12.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amanda and I will</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.529" end="00:57:14.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; rest at a silk shop</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.729" end="00:57:18.729" style="s2">and change our clothes.</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.729" end="00:57:18.729" style="s2">These clothes are far too flashy.</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.829" end="00:57:25.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Hannah.</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.929" end="00:57:27.929" style="s2">Once I reclaim the Vance family fortune,</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.929" end="00:57:31.729" style="s2">I&#39;ll marry you</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.929" end="00:57:31.729" style="s2">and give you and the child a home.</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.829" end="00:57:35.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, aren&#39;t we deserters? Are we turning</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.629" end="00:57:37.829" style="s2">ourselves in?</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.529" end="00:57:39.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up, you fool. Didn&#39;t Serena erase</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.829" end="00:57:41.929" style="s2">our registrations?</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.429" end="00:57:44.929" style="s2">Registrar Gable and I go way back.</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.929" end="00:57:46.029" style="s2">He&#39;ll make an exception for us.</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.929" end="00:57:47.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance?</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.029" end="00:57:48.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You remember me, then this should be</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.729" end="00:57:52.429" style="s2">easy.</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.729" end="00:57:52.429" style="s2">Registrar Gable, how have you been?</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.029" end="00:57:56.629" style="s2">I&#39;ve been away from the capital for</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.229" end="00:57:59.829" style="s2">years. I came back today to find a</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.629" end="00:58:01.529" style="s2">family named Carter in my house.</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.829" end="00:58:03.629" style="s2">Can you help me get it back?</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.529" end="00:58:05.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Surely you jest, Mr. Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.629" end="00:58:08.129" style="s2">That house, your wife and</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.329" end="00:58:10.629" style="s2">daughter-in-law sold it long ago.</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.129" end="00:58:12.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was the Vance family home.</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.629" end="00:58:13.929" style="s2">Even if they sold it, the money should</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.429" end="00:58:15.429" style="s2">be mine.</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.929" end="00:58:16.429" style="s2">How could it go to a woman who isn&#39;t a</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.429" end="00:58:18.929" style="s2">Vance?</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.429" end="00:58:20.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a family matter. I can&#39;t help you</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.929" end="00:58:23.329" style="s2">with that.</p>
<p begin="00:58:20.129" end="00:58:25.329" style="s2">If there&#39;s nothing else, please leave.</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.329" end="00:58:27.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget the house for now. How about</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.329" end="00:58:29.429" style="s2">this? Give me proof of registration so I</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.929" end="00:58:32.129" style="s2">can book a room at the inn.</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.429" end="00:58:34.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m afraid I can&#39;t do that, Mr. Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.129" end="00:58:35.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean [music] you can&#39;t?</p>
<p begin="00:58:34.029" end="00:58:37.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three years ago, Serena brought a</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.729" end="00:58:39.429" style="s2">military death notice to this office.</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.829" end="00:58:40.829" style="s2">She erased your and your son&#39;s [music]</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.429" end="00:58:43.329" style="s2">records and collected the death</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.829" end="00:58:46.929" style="s2">benefits. Officially, you&#39;re both dead</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.329" end="00:58:46.929" style="s2">now and have no registration.</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.429" end="00:58:51.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She really erased our records the day</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.429" end="00:58:53.529" style="s2">she got our death notice.</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.729" end="00:58:55.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Registrar Gable, my father and I are</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.529" end="00:58:56.629" style="s2">alive and back.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.129" end="00:58:57.729" style="s2">You can restore our registrations,</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.629" end="00:58:58.929" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.729" end="00:59:00.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance,</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.929" end="00:59:02.429" style="s2">restoring your registrations isn&#39;t my</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.729" end="00:59:04.245" style="s2">decision alone.</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.429" end="00:59:06.529" style="s2">We don&#39;t know if that death notice</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.245" end="00:59:09.329" style="s2">[music] was a military error or if</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.529" end="00:59:12.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, he can&#39;t suspect we&#39;re deserters.</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.329" end="00:59:12.329" style="s2">Julian, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.829" end="00:59:17.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, Victor is petty and vindictive.</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.031" end="00:59:19.331" style="s2">He&#39;s down on his luck now, but don&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.931" end="00:59:21.931" style="s2">your guard down.</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.331" end="00:59:24.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Victor has no papers and the Vances</p>
<p begin="00:59:21.931" end="00:59:25.631" style="s2">struck him from the family rolls. as</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.031" end="00:59:28.031" style="s2">good as dead.</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.631" end="00:59:31.431" style="s2">may have held power once, but his old</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.031" end="00:59:33.731" style="s2">colleagues can read the room.</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.431" end="00:59:34.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m your master&#39;s close friend. How dare</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.731" end="00:59:36.731" style="s2">you turn me away?</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.831" end="00:59:38.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My master says he knows no one named</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.731" end="00:59:40.131" style="s2">Vance. Please leave.</p>
<p begin="00:59:38.231" end="00:59:42.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can this be?</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.131" end="00:59:44.431" style="s2">Qian Manor once offered their daughter</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.131" end="00:59:45.931" style="s2">as my son&#39;s concubine. How can they be</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.431" end="00:59:47.931" style="s2">so cruel now?</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.931" end="00:59:49.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still think you&#39;re a high official? You</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.931" end="00:59:52.231" style="s2">don&#39;t even have papers. You&#39;re an</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.831" end="00:59:53.431" style="s2">unregistered vagrant. Anyone near you is</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.231" end="00:59:57.031" style="s2">bad luck.</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.431" end="00:59:59.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, this is the 10th house we&#39;ve tried.</p>
<p begin="00:59:57.031" end="01:00:03.031" style="s2">Not one will see us. Let&#39;s go back.</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.931" end="01:00:05.531" style="s2">We can try another day.</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.031" end="01:00:08.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See, mom, that&#39;s how it goes. Once you</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.531" end="01:00:10.231" style="s2">fall, your friends scatter.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.131" end="01:00:13.031" style="s2">Without us to rely on,</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.231" end="01:00:14.231" style="s2">they&#39;re nothing but stray dogs.</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.031" end="01:00:17.131" style="s2">Victor,</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.231" end="01:00:17.131" style="s2">look at you now.</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.131" end="01:00:23.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evelyn, Serena, you vicious women, get</p>
<p begin="01:00:22.231" end="01:00:26.831" style="s2">down here.</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.931" end="01:00:29.531" style="s2">You did this to me. I&#39;ll kill you both.</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.831" end="01:00:32.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, come back. I&#39;ll care for you till</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.531" end="01:00:34.931" style="s2">you die. Don&#39;t listen to Serena. She&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.431" end="01:00:37.331" style="s2">only hurt you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.931" end="01:00:39.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stray dogs, even at death&#39;s door, you</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.331" end="01:00:42.231" style="s2">feel no remorse.</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.431" end="01:00:42.231" style="s2">Come on, mom.</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.231" end="01:00:46.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.131" end="01:00:46.731" style="s2">are you okay?</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.531" end="01:00:53.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is outrageous.</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.731" end="01:00:54.731" style="s2">I&#39;ve never suffered such humiliation in</p>
<p begin="01:00:53.031" end="01:00:57.131" style="s2">my life.</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.731" end="01:00:59.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve seen enough, mom.</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.131" end="01:01:01.231" style="s2">Let&#39;s go back to Silk River City. Time</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.231" end="01:01:03.431" style="s2">to focus on our work.</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.231" end="01:01:05.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trust that ungrateful son to care for me</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.431" end="01:01:08.431" style="s2">till I die. I&#39;d rather live off my</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.831" end="01:01:10.831" style="s2">embroidery.</p>
<p begin="01:01:08.431" end="01:01:13.331" style="s2">You spent all day finding this dump. The</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.831" end="01:01:14.431" style="s2">roof still leaks. How am I supposed to</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.331" end="01:01:17.232" style="s2">live here?</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.431" end="01:01:19.632" style="s2">Victor, I&#39;m carrying your child. How</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.232" end="01:01:22.232" style="s2">dare you treat me like this?</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.632" end="01:01:24.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anna, we can&#39;t live off our savings.</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.232" end="01:01:27.732" style="s2">Your dowry all went to the wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:01:24.732" end="01:01:30.032" style="s2">I&#39;m nearly out of money, too.</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.732" end="01:01:31.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about your fellow officials?</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.032" end="01:01:32.732" style="s2">Weren&#39;t you close with them?</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.832" end="01:01:34.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh,</p>
<p begin="01:01:32.732" end="01:01:35.932" style="s2">don&#39;t ask.</p>
<p begin="01:01:34.332" end="01:01:37.732" style="s2">Who knew they were all fair-weather</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.932" end="01:01:39.932" style="s2">friends?</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.732" end="01:01:40.932" style="s2">They won&#39;t lend me money or even let me</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.932" end="01:01:42.932" style="s2">in.</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.932" end="01:01:44.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care about any of that.</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.932" end="01:01:45.832" style="s2">I need someone to tend to me while I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.632" end="01:01:47.932" style="s2">pregnant</p>
<p begin="01:01:45.832" end="01:01:50.932" style="s2">and good food and clothes.</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.932" end="01:01:50.932" style="s2">If you can&#39;t do that,</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.032" end="01:01:56.032" style="s2">forget about the baby.</p>
<p begin="01:01:53.832" end="01:01:58.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.032" end="01:02:00.332" style="s2">Anna, tomorrow morning, I&#39;ll find a way</p>
<p begin="01:01:58.532" end="01:02:02.632" style="s2">to earn a living.</p>
<p begin="01:02:00.332" end="01:02:06.232" style="s2">I, Victor, give my word</p>
<p begin="01:02:02.632" end="01:02:06.232" style="s2">you and our baby won&#39;t go without.</p>
<p begin="01:02:07.332" end="01:02:10.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, what do we do tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.732" end="01:02:12.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:02:10.932" end="01:02:16.132" style="s2">Search the whole capital and drag those</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.932" end="01:02:16.132" style="s2">two little cuties out.</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.532" end="01:02:22.332" style="s2">Shopkeeper, what&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.732" end="01:02:25.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our rooms have a two-person limit, but</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.332" end="01:02:27.932" style="s2">look at you, all four crammed into one.</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.332" end="01:02:27.932" style="s2">That broke</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.032" end="01:02:31.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shopkeeper, everyone has their troubles</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.632" end="01:02:34.032" style="s2">away from home. Please show us some</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.732" end="01:02:36.032" style="s2">mercy. Give us a few more days.</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.032" end="01:02:37.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If it were anyone else, I could look the</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.032" end="01:02:38.932" style="s2">other way.</p>
<p begin="01:02:37.132" end="01:02:41.032" style="s2">But you, of all people, a vagrant with</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.932" end="01:02:43.132" style="s2">no proof of identity, if I take you in,</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.032" end="01:02:44.432" style="s2">I&#39;d only be inviting trouble.</p>
<p begin="01:02:43.132" end="01:02:47.332" style="s2">If you know what&#39;s good for you, you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.432" end="01:02:47.332" style="s2">move out quietly.</p>
<p begin="01:02:48.532" end="01:02:50.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move out?</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.832" end="01:02:52.732" style="s2">Why should we?</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.732" end="01:02:54.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ahem. These two have no household</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.732" end="01:02:56.432" style="s2">registration. Under the imperial laws of</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.832" end="01:02:57.332" style="s2">Liang, they must be driven out of the</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.432" end="01:02:59.732" style="s2">capital.</p>
<p begin="01:02:57.332" end="01:03:01.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Driven out of the capital?</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.732" end="01:03:03.532" style="s2">Victor Vance, you once claimed to be a</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.632" end="01:03:06.132" style="s2">sixth-rank military officer. Now you</p>
<p begin="01:03:03.532" end="01:03:08.132" style="s2">lack even a registration.</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.132" end="01:03:10.032" style="s2">You&#39;ve been lying to me all along.</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.132" end="01:03:13.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anna, you&#39;ve got it all wrong. It&#39;s all</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.032" end="01:03:15.432" style="s2">that vicious woman Serena&#39;s fault.</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.332" end="01:03:17.532" style="s2">The moment she learned I died in battle,</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.432" end="01:03:19.533" style="s2">she had my registration canceled.</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.532" end="01:03:20.933" style="s2">She cut off my every escape. There was</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.533" end="01:03:22.733" style="s2">nothing I could do.</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.933" end="01:03:24.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Enough.</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.733" end="01:03:26.533" style="s2">Making such a racket first thing in the</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.533" end="01:03:29.033" style="s2">morning. How am I supposed to run my</p>
<p begin="01:03:26.533" end="01:03:30.933" style="s2">business? Someone</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.033" end="01:03:32.633" style="s2">throw them all out.</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.933" end="01:03:34.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You greedy merchant.</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.633" end="01:03:35.633" style="s2">We paid for our rooms.</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.533" end="01:03:37.633" style="s2">What gives you the right to throw us</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.633" end="01:03:39.533" style="s2">out?</p>
<p begin="01:03:37.633" end="01:03:41.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What gives me the right?</p>
<p begin="01:03:39.533" end="01:03:43.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare a bunch of vagrants act up</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.433" end="01:03:46.333" style="s2">before me? Do you want me to call the</p>
<p begin="01:03:43.733" end="01:03:47.933" style="s2">authorities?</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.333" end="01:03:49.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What sin did I commit to come to the</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.933" end="01:03:51.533" style="s2">capital with you?</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.733" end="01:03:54.033" style="s2">I got nothing out of it.</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.533" end="01:03:55.833" style="s2">I&#39;ve spent all my travel money. Victor,</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.033" end="01:03:59.433" style="s2">pay me back. Pay me back.</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.833" end="01:04:01.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anna, stop. Stop hitting me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.433" end="01:04:03.033" style="s2">I never expected things to turn out like</p>
<p begin="01:04:01.233" end="01:04:04.533" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.033" end="01:04:05.733" style="s2">I&#39;ve only been gone from home for 3</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.533" end="01:04:07.133" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.733" end="01:04:08.933" style="s2">That wretched woman Evelyn ruined</p>
<p begin="01:04:07.133" end="01:04:10.333" style="s2">everything. Even my own son won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.933" end="01:04:11.633" style="s2">acknowledge me.</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.333" end="01:04:13.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her again.</p>
<p begin="01:04:11.633" end="01:04:15.333" style="s2">If she&#39;s the one who caused all this</p>
<p begin="01:04:13.033" end="01:04:17.333" style="s2">trouble, then let&#39;s go find her. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.333" end="01:04:19.933" style="s2">only a woman. Are the four of us really</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.333" end="01:04:19.933" style="s2">afraid of her?</p>
<p begin="01:04:20.033" end="01:04:23.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Julian.</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.633" end="01:04:25.133" style="s2">Serena must have poisoned her against</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.233" end="01:04:28.333" style="s2">you, that wretch.</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.133" end="01:04:30.133" style="s2">She&#39;s just mad you left her.</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.333" end="01:04:31.733" style="s2">She still loves you. I&#39;m sure.</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.133" end="01:04:33.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.733" end="01:04:34.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.133" end="01:04:37.333" style="s2">She&#39;s your mother.</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.633" end="01:04:39.133" style="s2">You&#39;re her son. That&#39;ll never change.</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.333" end="01:04:40.733" style="s2">Even if she won&#39;t accept you, could she</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.133" end="01:04:41.433" style="s2">really turn away the grandchild I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.733" end="01:04:44.133" style="s2">carrying?</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.433" end="01:04:45.504" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amanda, we&#39;ve never slept together. How</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.133" end="01:04:45.633" style="s2">could you be pregnant?</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.504" end="01:04:47.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.633" end="01:04:49.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not pregnant.</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.333" end="01:04:51.333" style="s2">But if your mom lets me in,</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.533" end="01:04:52.733" style="s2">we&#39;ll have plenty of chances.</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.333" end="01:04:55.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well said.</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.733" end="01:04:57.633" style="s2">Yesterday, I saw their carriage rush out</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.033" end="01:04:59.533" style="s2">of town. By the look of it,</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.633" end="01:05:02.133" style="s2">I&#39;ll ask around</p>
<p begin="01:04:59.533" end="01:05:03.633" style="s2">and find where those two live.</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.133" end="01:05:05.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom works tirelessly [music] at her</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.633" end="01:05:06.833" style="s2">shop.</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.133" end="01:05:08.633" style="s2">Now her fame is growing.</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.833" end="01:05:11.133" style="s2">Everyone in Silk River City respects</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.633" end="01:05:13.933" style="s2">Madame Evelyn.</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.133" end="01:05:16.033" style="s2">Victor and Julian are desperate now.</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.933" end="01:05:18.033" style="s2">They won&#39;t give up.</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.033" end="01:05:20.533" style="s2">If they find us,</p>
<p begin="01:05:18.033" end="01:05:23.035" style="s2">I need a plan and fast.</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.533" end="01:05:25.335" style="s2">I can&#39;t let them ruin our new life.</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.035" end="01:05:26.735" style="s2">I almost forgot. Last time, their</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.335" end="01:05:28.735" style="s2">desertion stayed hidden because they</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.735" end="01:05:31.035" style="s2">later saved his majesty in Silk River</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.735" end="01:05:32.335" style="s2">City. That earned them his favor. So he</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.035" end="01:05:36.235" style="s2">dropped the White River crossing</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.335" end="01:05:36.235" style="s2">inquiry. That should be any day now.</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.335" end="01:05:38.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am?</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.835" end="01:05:40.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hire some guards.</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.435" end="01:05:42.235" style="s2">There may be cholera in Silk River City</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.135" end="01:05:43.535" style="s2">soon. Have them patrol West District</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.235" end="01:05:46.635" style="s2">daily. [music] If there&#39;s an enemy</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.535" end="01:05:47.935" style="s2">attack, they must save anyone in danger.</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.635" end="01:05:50.235" style="s2">No mistakes.</p>
<p begin="01:05:47.935" end="01:05:50.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.535" end="01:05:55.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor, Julian, this time I&#39;m taking</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.535" end="01:05:58.935" style="s2">your chance to win favor.</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.435" end="01:05:58.935" style="s2">You&#39;ll never rise again.</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.335" end="01:06:03.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are we in Silk River City yet?</p>
<p begin="01:06:01.435" end="01:06:07.135" style="s2">It&#39;s been days. Why haven&#39;t we seen a</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.935" end="01:06:09.635" style="s2">trace of that wretched woman?</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.135" end="01:06:11.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re here. We&#39;re here. The officers</p>
<p begin="01:06:09.635" end="01:06:13.835" style="s2">said their carriage was headed for Silk</p>
<p begin="01:06:11.435" end="01:06:16.035" style="s2">River City, but around here, we don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.835" end="01:06:18.335" style="s2">know a soul. I can&#39;t find them right</p>
<p begin="01:06:16.035" end="01:06:20.435" style="s2">away. Let&#39;s find an inn first.</p>
<p begin="01:06:18.335" end="01:06:23.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine Silk River embroidery.</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.435" end="01:06:23.735" style="s2">Come take a look, folks.</p>
<p begin="01:06:24.235" end="01:06:29.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So this is the famous local embroidery.</p>
<p begin="01:06:26.935" end="01:06:30.035" style="s2">I hear even the palace ladies fight over</p>
<p begin="01:06:29.035" end="01:06:32.035" style="s2">a single bolt.</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.035" end="01:06:33.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good eye, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.035" end="01:06:35.635" style="s2">This fine Silk River embroidery is</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.935" end="01:06:36.935" style="s2">hand-stitched by the famous Madame</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.635" end="01:06:39.835" style="s2">Evelyn.</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.935" end="01:06:41.735" style="s2">Even noble ladies fight for a bolt.</p>
<p begin="01:06:39.835" end="01:06:43.535" style="s2">I waited a whole month just to get this</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.735" end="01:06:47.035" style="s2">one bolt.</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.535" end="01:06:47.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madame Evelyn? You mean Evelyn Vance?</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.035" end="01:06:49.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yep.</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.935" end="01:06:50.335" style="s2">The biggest shop down the street is</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.335" end="01:06:51.835" style="s2">hers.</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.335" end="01:06:52.935" style="s2">Evelyn Vance.</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.835" end="01:06:54.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madame Evelyn.</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.935" end="01:06:57.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Umph, well, well.</p>
<p begin="01:06:54.935" end="01:06:59.135" style="s2">We searched high and low</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.135" end="01:07:01.135" style="s2">and found her right here.</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.135" end="01:07:04.235" style="s2">She took our fortune and hid here with</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.135" end="01:07:04.235" style="s2">an embroidery shop.</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.335" end="01:07:07.735" style="s2">Hannah, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.335" end="01:07:10.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie, wait.</p>
<p begin="01:07:07.735" end="01:07:11.335" style="s2">We can&#39;t rush in like we did last time.</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.035" end="01:07:12.535" style="s2">Seeing you will only make Evelyn</p>
<p begin="01:07:11.335" end="01:07:16.535" style="s2">angrier.</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.535" end="01:07:16.535" style="s2">Anna seeing would alert the officers.</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.035" end="01:07:22.435" style="s2">Let Julian and me go talk to her.</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.935" end="01:07:24.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. Mom&#39;s always doted on me. When</p>
<p begin="01:07:22.435" end="01:07:26.736" style="s2">she sees me like this, she won&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.036" end="01:07:26.736" style="s2">the heart to leave me.</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.736" end="01:07:34.236" style="s2">Mom, I finally found you. You can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.436" end="01:07:36.136" style="s2">disown me.</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.236" end="01:07:38.136" style="s2">I was wrong before.</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.136" end="01:07:39.536" style="s2">For your grandchild&#39;s sake, please take</p>
<p begin="01:07:38.136" end="01:07:41.336" style="s2">Amanda and me in.</p>
<p begin="01:07:39.536" end="01:07:43.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What grandchild?</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.336" end="01:07:46.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I carry the Vance family&#39;s eldest</p>
<p begin="01:07:43.836" end="01:07:48.736" style="s2">rightful heir. Even if you hate me,</p>
<p begin="01:07:46.436" end="01:07:51.536" style="s2">please think of your unborn grandson and</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.736" end="01:07:53.436" style="s2">forgive us. In my past life, I never</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.536" end="01:07:55.636" style="s2">heard of Amanda being pregnant. They&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.436" end="01:07:58.436" style="s2">using a child to win her over.</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.636" end="01:08:01.336" style="s2">Too bad their plan won&#39;t work.</p>
<p begin="01:07:58.436" end="01:08:03.736" style="s2">Mom, you know about Julian&#39;s condition.</p>
<p begin="01:08:01.336" end="01:08:05.936" style="s2">Neither I nor his concubines have ever</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.736" end="01:08:07.836" style="s2">borne him a child.</p>
<p begin="01:08:05.936" end="01:08:09.936" style="s2">Someone must have fooled him.</p>
<p begin="01:08:07.836" end="01:08:12.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re Amanda, the woman Julian&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="01:08:09.936" end="01:08:14.636" style="s2">with for 3 years.</p>
<p begin="01:08:12.536" end="01:08:17.236" style="s2">That rumor has it he deserted the army</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.636" end="01:08:19.936" style="s2">to be your family&#39;s living son-in-law.</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.236" end="01:08:22.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, don&#39;t believe those rumors.</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.936" end="01:08:25.436" style="s2">3 years ago, I was wounded in battle and</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.036" end="01:08:26.736" style="s2">fell off a cliff. Amanda saved me.</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.436" end="01:08:29.736" style="s2">We&#39;ve lived together as husband and</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.736" end="01:08:32.936" style="s2">wife. Now Amanda is pregnant.</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.736" end="01:08:35.412" style="s2">I&#39;ll make her my wife.</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.936" end="01:08:35.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, your daughter-in-law greets you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:35.412" end="01:08:37.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:08:35.736" end="01:08:39.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you?</p>
<p begin="01:08:37.236" end="01:08:41.636" style="s2">You have no right to call me mother.</p>
<p begin="01:08:39.736" end="01:08:43.136" style="s2">Who is this peasant woman?</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.636" end="01:08:45.336" style="s2">Have you no shame?</p>
<p begin="01:08:43.136" end="01:08:45.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.436" end="01:08:49.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.036" end="01:08:50.736" style="s2">why did you hit Amanda?</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.436" end="01:08:54.536" style="s2">She&#39;s carrying a child of the Vance</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.736" end="01:08:56.336" style="s2">family, your eldest rightful grandson.</p>
<p begin="01:08:54.536" end="01:08:59.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eldest rightful grandson?</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.336" end="01:09:00.236" style="s2">Julian, have you forgotten? Serena is</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.136" end="01:09:02.267" style="s2">the wife you married with an</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.236" end="01:09:02.936" style="s2">eight-bearer sedan chair.</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.267" end="01:09:04.536" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.936" end="01:09:07.536" style="s2">Would you really defy your mother for a</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.536" end="01:09:10.636" style="s2">woman who isn&#39;t even family?</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.536" end="01:09:11.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Old madam, I overstepped just now.</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.636" end="01:09:13.736" style="s2">You needn&#39;t accept me as your</p>
<p begin="01:09:11.836" end="01:09:15.936" style="s2">daughter-in-law, but this child is the</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.736" end="01:09:18.036" style="s2">Vance family&#39;s only heir.</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.936" end="01:09:19.236" style="s2">Old madam, surely you&#39;ll give the child</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.036" end="01:09:20.936" style="s2">its rightful place.</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.236" end="01:09:22.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Julian&#39;s Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.936" end="01:09:23.936" style="s2">If you insist on using the child to</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.536" end="01:09:25.538" style="s2">pressure me,</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.936" end="01:09:26.938" style="s2">we&#39;ll settle this under Vance family</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.538" end="01:09:30.637" style="s2">discipline.</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.938" end="01:09:30.637" style="s2">Someone fetch a doctor.</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.438" end="01:09:38.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I&#39;m your own flesh and blood.</p>
<p begin="01:09:36.438" end="01:09:40.538" style="s2">Amanda&#39;s carrying a Vance child. How can</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.737" end="01:09:42.538" style="s2">you be so suspicious?</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.538" end="01:09:44.838" style="s2">That&#39;s downright heartless.</p>
<p begin="01:09:42.538" end="01:09:47.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian, for an outsider, you&#39;d yell at</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.838" end="01:09:49.237" style="s2">your own mother? You were gone for three</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.038" end="01:09:51.237" style="s2">years. We thought you were dead. Mother</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.237" end="01:09:53.038" style="s2">cried her eyes out over you, and you</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.237" end="01:09:55.538" style="s2">have the nerve to talk back to her?</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.038" end="01:09:57.738" style="s2">You&#39;re a disgraceful son.</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.538" end="01:10:00.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, you jealous woman.</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.738" end="01:10:02.338" style="s2">This is Vance family business.</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.137" end="01:10:05.038" style="s2">Who are you to butt in, woman?</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.338" end="01:10:06.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian, you ungrateful son.</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.038" end="01:10:08.538" style="s2">Three years ago, when I heard you and</p>
<p begin="01:10:06.637" end="01:10:10.238" style="s2">your father had died in battle, I nearly</p>
<p begin="01:10:08.538" end="01:10:12.438" style="s2">cried myself to death.</p>
<p begin="01:10:10.238" end="01:10:14.637" style="s2">Serena nearly followed you in death.</p>
<p begin="01:10:12.438" end="01:10:16.738" style="s2">And you?</p>
<p begin="01:10:14.637" end="01:10:19.137" style="s2">You&#39;re just like your father.</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.738" end="01:10:22.038" style="s2">You abandoned your wife and mother. How</p>
<p begin="01:10:19.137" end="01:10:24.637" style="s2">can anyone be as selfish as you?</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.038" end="01:10:26.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I didn&#39;t mean to, mom.</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.637" end="01:10:28.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, please calm down. I had you</p>
<p begin="01:10:26.738" end="01:10:30.538" style="s2">removed from the family registry, so</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.738" end="01:10:32.438" style="s2">we&#39;re no longer married. But she&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:10:30.538" end="01:10:34.238" style="s2">always be my mother. If you still</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.438" end="01:10:36.438" style="s2">consider yourself her son, let the</p>
<p begin="01:10:34.238" end="01:10:39.938" style="s2">doctor examine Amanda. It&#39;s for the</p>
<p begin="01:10:36.438" end="01:10:39.938" style="s2">Vance&#39;s legitimate grandson.</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.238" end="01:10:45.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, it&#39;s all my fault.</p>
<p begin="01:10:42.637" end="01:10:47.538" style="s2">Don&#39;t blame Julian. He was just anxious</p>
<p begin="01:10:45.137" end="01:10:50.238" style="s2">to give our child a rightful place.</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.538" end="01:10:52.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amanda, get up. You&#39;re pregnant. You</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.238" end="01:10:54.238" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t be kneeling.</p>
<p begin="01:10:52.137" end="01:10:57.338" style="s2">Now that you&#39;re pregnant,</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.238" end="01:11:00.038" style="s2">you should be careful.</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.338" end="01:11:01.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks. My mother has a kind heart. If</p>
<p begin="01:11:00.038" end="01:11:03.838" style="s2">you really are pregnant, we can make an</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.838" end="01:11:05.637" style="s2">exception for the baby&#39;s sake and let</p>
<p begin="01:11:03.838" end="01:11:06.938" style="s2">you both stay for now. But if you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:11:05.637" end="01:11:10.938" style="s2">not,</p>
<p begin="01:11:06.938" end="01:11:10.938" style="s2">you&#39;ll face the Vance family rules.</p>
<p begin="01:11:11.338" end="01:11:15.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vance rules.</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.738" end="01:11:18.538" style="s2">If you fake a pregnancy and deceive us,</p>
<p begin="01:11:15.238" end="01:11:20.338" style="s2">Vance rules call for two zero lashes.</p>
<p begin="01:11:18.538" end="01:11:23.938" style="s2">If you want into Vance Manor as its</p>
<p begin="01:11:20.338" end="01:11:25.938" style="s2">mistress, you should know those rules.</p>
<p begin="01:11:23.938" end="01:11:28.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, my respects.</p>
<p begin="01:11:25.938" end="01:11:28.639" style="s2">Who needs their pulse checked?</p>
<p begin="01:11:28.137" end="01:11:30.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam,</p>
<p begin="01:11:28.639" end="01:11:32.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not feeling well today. Julian,</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.939" end="01:11:33.139" style="s2">let&#39;s come back another day to pay our</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.439" end="01:11:34.939" style="s2">respects.</p>
<p begin="01:11:33.139" end="01:11:37.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="01:11:34.939" end="01:11:39.539" style="s2">Advanced embroidery workshop, you can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:11:37.239" end="01:11:41.939" style="s2">just come and go. Let the doctor take</p>
<p begin="01:11:39.539" end="01:11:44.439" style="s2">your pulse or be run out of Silk River</p>
<p begin="01:11:41.939" end="01:11:46.039" style="s2">City as a vagrant.</p>
<p begin="01:11:44.439" end="01:11:48.339" style="s2">Doctor,</p>
<p begin="01:11:46.039" end="01:11:49.439" style="s2">my dear sister claims to carry the Vance</p>
<p begin="01:11:48.339" end="01:11:51.739" style="s2">heir.</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.439" end="01:11:54.039" style="s2">Please examine her carefully.</p>
<p begin="01:11:51.739" end="01:11:54.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:11:56.239" end="01:12:00.239" style="s2">Madam, pregnancy makes the pulse strong</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.639" end="01:12:01.739" style="s2">and slippery.</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.239" end="01:12:04.739" style="s2">Pulse is steady.</p>
<p begin="01:12:01.739" end="01:12:06.639" style="s2">How could she be pregnant?</p>
<p begin="01:12:04.739" end="01:12:09.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re lying.</p>
<p begin="01:12:06.639" end="01:12:12.339" style="s2">I know I&#39;m pregnant. I&#39;m often nauseous</p>
<p begin="01:12:09.439" end="01:12:14.439" style="s2">too. You too must be in league.</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.339" end="01:12:15.439" style="s2">You bribed him to smear me.</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.439" end="01:12:17.339" style="s2">Julian,</p>
<p begin="01:12:15.439" end="01:12:18.339" style="s2">you have to stand up for me.</p>
<p begin="01:12:17.339" end="01:12:19.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.339" end="01:12:23.939" style="s2">Amanda and I have been intimate for a</p>
<p begin="01:12:19.739" end="01:12:23.939" style="s2">long time. You can&#39;t trust this doctor.</p>
<p begin="01:12:26.539" end="01:12:30.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve practiced medicine for decades and</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.939" end="01:12:32.939" style="s2">never once been wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:12:30.639" end="01:12:34.739" style="s2">I&#39;ve never met this lady.</p>
<p begin="01:12:32.939" end="01:12:35.739" style="s2">Why would I take a bribe to frame</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.739" end="01:12:37.539" style="s2">someone?</p>
<p begin="01:12:35.739" end="01:12:40.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, doctor.</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.539" end="01:12:44.639" style="s2">You may go now, doctor.</p>
<p begin="01:12:40.439" end="01:12:44.639" style="s2">Time to enforce the family rules.</p>
<p begin="01:12:46.939" end="01:12:49.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.939" end="01:12:55.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, you vicious woman. Mom,</p>
<p begin="01:12:53.839" end="01:12:58.439" style="s2">Amanda is my sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.939" end="01:13:01.239" style="s2">Why are you so heartless? Do you have to</p>
<p begin="01:12:58.439" end="01:13:01.239" style="s2">destroy her?</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.339" end="01:13:07.139" style="s2">Serena, you vicious woman.</p>
<p begin="01:13:03.639" end="01:13:10.039" style="s2">Mom, Amanda is my sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.139" end="01:13:11.039" style="s2">Why be so heartless? Must you destroy</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.039" end="01:13:12.939" style="s2">us?</p>
<p begin="01:13:11.039" end="01:13:14.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me, cruel?</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.939" end="01:13:16.539" style="s2">You and your father faked your deaths</p>
<p begin="01:13:14.739" end="01:13:17.739" style="s2">and deserted, then lived it up</p>
<p begin="01:13:16.539" end="01:13:19.839" style="s2">elsewhere.</p>
<p begin="01:13:17.739" end="01:13:22.339" style="s2">Did you think of us?</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.839" end="01:13:24.839" style="s2">When you and dad wanted second wives,</p>
<p begin="01:13:22.339" end="01:13:26.339" style="s2">did you consider us?</p>
<p begin="01:13:24.839" end="01:13:27.539" style="s2">Had I known you were just like your</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.339" end="01:13:31.640" style="s2">father,</p>
<p begin="01:13:27.539" end="01:13:34.340" style="s2">I&#39;d wish I&#39;d never given birth to you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.640" end="01:13:36.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Caleb, help me.</p>
<p begin="01:13:34.340" end="01:13:36.840" style="s2">It hurts.</p>
<p begin="01:13:37.240" end="01:13:42.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Serena, I was wrong before.</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.240" end="01:13:43.540" style="s2">I wasn&#39;t thinking straight. Punish me if</p>
<p begin="01:13:42.140" end="01:13:45.640" style="s2">you must.</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.540" end="01:13:48.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop hitting Amanda.</p>
<p begin="01:13:45.640" end="01:13:51.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After all this, why put on that pitiful</p>
<p begin="01:13:48.340" end="01:13:52.740" style="s2">act? You&#39;re the one who got her hurt.</p>
<p begin="01:13:51.040" end="01:13:54.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.740" end="01:13:57.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She never had to take that beating.</p>
<p begin="01:13:54.740" end="01:13:59.740" style="s2">You let her walk all over me. You defied</p>
<p begin="01:13:57.440" end="01:14:02.940" style="s2">your mother for her. You let her lie to</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.740" end="01:14:05.440" style="s2">us. Your divided loyalties hurt us all.</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.940" end="01:14:06.740" style="s2">Julian, you&#39;re the one to blame.</p>
<p begin="01:14:05.440" end="01:14:10.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, not me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:06.740" end="01:14:10.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian, you&#39;re a coward.</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.840" end="01:14:17.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amanda, Amanda, are you okay? Wake up.</p>
<p begin="01:14:15.240" end="01:14:20.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She passed out from the pain. Get her to</p>
<p begin="01:14:17.340" end="01:14:24.040" style="s2">a doctor, quick. Wait any longer and</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.040" end="01:14:24.040" style="s2">she&#39;ll be crippled if she survives.</p>
<p begin="01:14:26.940" end="01:14:31.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In my past life, they bullied me</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.740" end="01:14:33.640" style="s2">relentlessly and put me through hell.</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.340" end="01:14:36.440" style="s2">Today, I&#39;m only collecting a little</p>
<p begin="01:14:33.640" end="01:14:38.740" style="s2">interest from them.</p>
<p begin="01:14:36.440" end="01:14:40.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, it&#39;s windy out here. Let&#39;s go</p>
<p begin="01:14:38.740" end="01:14:42.840" style="s2">inside.</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.540" end="01:14:42.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:14:44.140" end="01:14:47.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, it&#39;s all taken care of. That</p>
<p begin="01:14:46.040" end="01:14:50.040" style="s2">gentleman is waiting in the side room.</p>
<p begin="01:14:47.940" end="01:14:52.340" style="s2">He wants to see you.</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.040" end="01:14:54.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Make sure he&#39;s comfortable and</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.340" end="01:14:56.840" style="s2">don&#39;t tell anyone. I&#39;ll change and be</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.340" end="01:14:56.840" style="s2">right there.</p>
<p begin="01:14:58.940" end="01:15:03.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, mom, our benefactor is here.</p>
<p begin="01:15:11.440" end="01:15:16.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lord, this is Madame Evelyn, our</p>
<p begin="01:15:13.440" end="01:15:16.040" style="s2">embroiderer.</p>
<p begin="01:15:16.740" end="01:15:22.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for saving my life just now.</p>
<p begin="01:15:19.740" end="01:15:24.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re too kind, sir. I only run an</p>
<p begin="01:15:22.040" end="01:15:26.340" style="s2">embroidery workshop. I hired guards to</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.340" end="01:15:28.440" style="s2">protect us and they help keep this area</p>
<p begin="01:15:26.340" end="01:15:29.240" style="s2">safe, too. Doing good lets us live in</p>
<p begin="01:15:28.440" end="01:15:31.540" style="s2">peace.</p>
<p begin="01:15:29.240" end="01:15:33.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never imagined a workshop this big</p>
<p begin="01:15:31.540" end="01:15:35.642" style="s2">could be run by a woman.</p>
<p begin="01:15:33.942" end="01:15:38.242" style="s2">Neither of you has a husband.</p>
<p begin="01:15:35.642" end="01:15:40.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You see, sir, she&#39;s my mother</p>
<p begin="01:15:38.242" end="01:15:42.142" style="s2">My husband and his father died in battle</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.142" end="01:15:44.242" style="s2">three years ago. Mother and I moved to</p>
<p begin="01:15:42.142" end="01:15:46.542" style="s2">Silk River City to survive. Times are</p>
<p begin="01:15:44.242" end="01:15:49.742" style="s2">hard, especially for women. That&#39;s why</p>
<p begin="01:15:46.542" end="01:15:52.442" style="s2">we hired guards for our home.</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.742" end="01:15:54.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see. You too have suffered. I came</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.442" end="01:15:57.042" style="s2">here incognito to see how my people live</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.742" end="01:15:58.342" style="s2">and inspect the officials. Yet you saved</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.042" end="01:16:00.142" style="s2">my life.</p>
<p begin="01:15:58.342" end="01:16:03.042" style="s2">What reward would you like?</p>
<p begin="01:16:00.142" end="01:16:03.042" style="s2">Just say the word.</p>
<p begin="01:16:03.242" end="01:16:09.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I didn&#39;t know it was your majesty.</p>
<p begin="01:16:06.442" end="01:16:10.842" style="s2">Forgive my rudeness just now, your</p>
<p begin="01:16:09.042" end="01:16:14.142" style="s2">majesty.</p>
<p begin="01:16:10.842" end="01:16:16.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need for that. Please get up.</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.142" end="01:16:18.142" style="s2">I came here incognito. After all, you</p>
<p begin="01:16:16.742" end="01:16:19.242" style="s2">saved my life.</p>
<p begin="01:16:18.142" end="01:16:21.642" style="s2">I must repay you.</p>
<p begin="01:16:19.242" end="01:16:23.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The emperor is suspicious. If I ask for</p>
<p begin="01:16:21.642" end="01:16:26.942" style="s2">something now, he&#39;ll suspect me. It</p>
<p begin="01:16:23.742" end="01:16:29.242" style="s2">could backfire. Thank you, your majesty.</p>
<p begin="01:16:26.942" end="01:16:31.642" style="s2">I ask for very little. We have food and</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.242" end="01:16:34.642" style="s2">shelter and my mother in law as well.</p>
<p begin="01:16:31.642" end="01:16:34.642" style="s2">That&#39;s more than enough.</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.842" end="01:16:41.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have a rare kind heart.</p>
<p begin="01:16:40.242" end="01:16:44.042" style="s2">You ask for no riches and your</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.942" end="01:16:45.942" style="s2">embroidery is superb.</p>
<p begin="01:16:44.042" end="01:16:48.342" style="s2">In that case, I&#39;ll inscribe a plaque</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.942" end="01:16:49.242" style="s2">myself to honor your workshop.</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.342" end="01:16:52.342" style="s2">Haha.</p>
<p begin="01:16:49.242" end="01:16:56.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, your majesty, Victor Julian.</p>
<p begin="01:16:52.342" end="01:16:56.642" style="s2">This time you&#39;ll never get back on top.</p>
<p begin="01:16:56.942" end="01:17:01.042" style="s2">Cough, cough.</p>
<p begin="01:16:59.042" end="01:17:02.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here, Amanda, at least take a sip.</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.042" end="01:17:04.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s your fault.</p>
<p begin="01:17:02.742" end="01:17:05.042" style="s2">You coward.</p>
<p begin="01:17:04.042" end="01:17:06.542" style="s2">You did this to me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.042" end="01:17:08.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t think this would happen.</p>
<p begin="01:17:06.542" end="01:17:09.642" style="s2">Besides, faking the pregnancy was your</p>
<p begin="01:17:08.342" end="01:17:11.442" style="s2">idea too.</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.642" end="01:17:13.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor, you monster.</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.442" end="01:17:16.142" style="s2">Ever since I joined you, I haven&#39;t had a</p>
<p begin="01:17:13.342" end="01:17:18.742" style="s2">single good day. I pawned all my jewelry</p>
<p begin="01:17:16.142" end="01:17:20.942" style="s2">for medicine and we can&#39;t even afford an</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.742" end="01:17:23.742" style="s2">inn. We&#39;re crammed into this ruined</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.942" end="01:17:25.242" style="s2">temple. That mother and daughter in law,</p>
<p begin="01:17:23.742" end="01:17:27.242" style="s2">they run an embroidery shop and a</p>
<p begin="01:17:25.242" end="01:17:28.542" style="s2">bakery.</p>
<p begin="01:17:27.242" end="01:17:30.442" style="s2">Sam,</p>
<p begin="01:17:28.542" end="01:17:32.542" style="s2">you came too soon.</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.442" end="01:17:33.542" style="s2">Forgive mom for giving you up.</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.542" end="01:17:35.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="01:17:33.542" end="01:17:38.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In Green Hills, you said you were a</p>
<p begin="01:17:35.042" end="01:17:40.343" style="s2">sixth rank military officer, owned 165</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.043" end="01:17:42.343" style="s2">acres of farmland and countless shops.</p>
<p begin="01:17:40.343" end="01:17:44.543" style="s2">If I wed you with my fortune, I&#39;d join</p>
<p begin="01:17:42.343" end="01:17:46.443" style="s2">the capital&#39;s noble ladies. I&#39;d want for</p>
<p begin="01:17:44.543" end="01:17:47.943" style="s2">nothing and live in style.</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.443" end="01:17:51.243" style="s2">But now,</p>
<p begin="01:17:47.943" end="01:17:52.943" style="s2">you can&#39;t even prove who you are.</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.243" end="01:17:56.043" style="s2">How can you marry me</p>
<p begin="01:17:52.943" end="01:17:56.043" style="s2">with your big mouth?</p>
<p begin="01:17:59.143" end="01:18:04.743" style="s2">One more thing, my niece is so weak now.</p>
<p begin="01:18:02.643" end="01:18:06.943" style="s2">I won&#39;t ask you to care for her.</p>
<p begin="01:18:04.743" end="01:18:08.643" style="s2">Just give her $500</p>
<p begin="01:18:06.943" end="01:18:09.443" style="s2">so she&#39;s provided for the rest of her</p>
<p begin="01:18:08.643" end="01:18:13.843" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="01:18:09.443" end="01:18:15.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $500? I don&#39;t even have $5.</p>
<p begin="01:18:13.843" end="01:18:17.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sure you want to give up this</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.443" end="01:18:19.143" style="s2">child?</p>
<p begin="01:18:17.243" end="01:18:21.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I want to?</p>
<p begin="01:18:19.143" end="01:18:24.243" style="s2">We can barely survive ourselves.</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.543" end="01:18:26.743" style="s2">Amanda&#39;s medicine costs a fortune.</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.243" end="01:18:28.743" style="s2">How can we keep him?</p>
<p begin="01:18:26.743" end="01:18:31.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s my fault.</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.743" end="01:18:33.543" style="s2">In that case,</p>
<p begin="01:18:31.543" end="01:18:37.243" style="s2">then let this child</p>
<p begin="01:18:33.543" end="01:18:37.243" style="s2">at least die for a purpose.</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.543" end="01:18:41.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since we hung His Majesty&#39;s Imperial</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.443" end="01:18:44.543" style="s2">plaque, our workshops have become</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.443" end="01:18:46.443" style="s2">famous. Orders are pouring in. Even</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.543" end="01:18:49.543" style="s2">high-born ladies come to snap up our</p>
<p begin="01:18:46.443" end="01:18:51.643" style="s2">silk. Mrs. Sterling, you just got a fine</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.543" end="01:18:52.343" style="s2">bolt of Suzhou silk. Let me have this</p>
<p begin="01:18:51.643" end="01:18:54.243" style="s2">one today.</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.343" end="01:18:55.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Mrs. Crawford, I&#39;m not fighting you</p>
<p begin="01:18:54.243" end="01:18:57.343" style="s2">for it. This color&#39;s too drab for your</p>
<p begin="01:18:55.943" end="01:18:58.743" style="s2">complexion.</p>
<p begin="01:18:57.343" end="01:19:00.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me have it.</p>
<p begin="01:18:58.743" end="01:19:02.843" style="s2">I don&#39;t care.</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.143" end="01:19:02.843" style="s2">Give it to me.</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.543" end="01:19:07.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Life without waiting on men is</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.543" end="01:19:09.343" style="s2">wonderfully free.</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.843" end="01:19:11.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, it&#39;s bad.</p>
<p begin="01:19:09.343" end="01:19:13.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Baker, you run the delicacy shop on</p>
<p begin="01:19:11.643" end="01:19:14.543" style="s2">your own now. What&#39;s got you so worked</p>
<p begin="01:19:13.443" end="01:19:17.043" style="s2">up today?</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.543" end="01:19:18.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, it&#39;s my fault.</p>
<p begin="01:19:17.043" end="01:19:19.843" style="s2">Someone got food poisoning at the</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.343" end="01:19:22.843" style="s2">delicacy shop.</p>
<p begin="01:19:19.843" end="01:19:22.843" style="s2">It&#39;s all my fault.</p>
<p begin="01:19:25.843" end="01:19:30.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go there first. Tell me exactly</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.443" end="01:19:32.443" style="s2">what happened on the way.</p>
<p begin="01:19:30.243" end="01:19:34.443" style="s2">Don&#39;t leave out a single detail.</p>
<p begin="01:19:32.443" end="01:19:36.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I need to rush to the sock weaving</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.443" end="01:19:39.244" style="s2">shop. See to the customers here.</p>
<p begin="01:19:36.643" end="01:19:41.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax, Serena. Go. I&#39;ll come when I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:19:39.244" end="01:19:41.545" style="s2">done.</p>
<p begin="01:19:42.144" end="01:19:45.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s what happened.</p>
<p begin="01:19:43.844" end="01:19:46.945" style="s2">Somehow, he lay down there and refuses</p>
<p begin="01:19:45.844" end="01:19:48.744" style="s2">to leave.</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.945" end="01:19:49.844" style="s2">He says we killed someone and wants our</p>
<p begin="01:19:48.744" end="01:19:51.644" style="s2">lives.</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.844" end="01:19:54.045" style="s2">I feared trouble, so I called you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:51.644" end="01:19:56.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand. I&#39;ve got this. Don&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="01:19:54.045" end="01:19:56.545" style="s2">afraid.</p>
<p begin="01:20:02.844" end="01:20:08.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, you vicious woman, pay for my</p>
<p begin="01:20:05.545" end="01:20:11.445" style="s2">own brother&#39;s life.</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.644" end="01:20:14.344" style="s2">Serena, you vicious woman, you owe me my</p>
<p begin="01:20:11.445" end="01:20:14.344" style="s2">brother&#39;s life.</p>
<p begin="01:20:15.344" end="01:20:20.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you? Show her respect.</p>
<p begin="01:20:17.644" end="01:20:22.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get a doctor now.</p>
<p begin="01:20:20.144" end="01:20:25.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is an outrage.</p>
<p begin="01:20:22.144" end="01:20:26.744" style="s2">Serena, you monster, you stole all my</p>
<p begin="01:20:25.045" end="01:20:28.144" style="s2">family&#39;s wealth, and now you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:20:26.744" end="01:20:31.344" style="s2">destroying us.</p>
<p begin="01:20:28.144" end="01:20:33.744" style="s2">You tore my father&#39;s family apart.</p>
<p begin="01:20:31.344" end="01:20:36.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, hear me out.</p>
<p begin="01:20:33.744" end="01:20:37.045" style="s2">Three years ago, Julian and I went to</p>
<p begin="01:20:36.045" end="01:20:38.945" style="s2">war.</p>
<p begin="01:20:37.045" end="01:20:40.545" style="s2">My daughter-in-law Serena lied, saying</p>
<p begin="01:20:38.945" end="01:20:41.945" style="s2">we died in battle.</p>
<p begin="01:20:40.545" end="01:20:43.545" style="s2">She had us removed from the family</p>
<p begin="01:20:41.945" end="01:20:44.744" style="s2">register and did as she pleased in our</p>
<p begin="01:20:43.545" end="01:20:46.844" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.744" end="01:20:49.744" style="s2">She sold off our property and sold our</p>
<p begin="01:20:46.844" end="01:20:52.545" style="s2">concubines. Now she&#39;s taking revenge on</p>
<p begin="01:20:49.744" end="01:20:55.244" style="s2">my son and me, even poisoning my wife to</p>
<p begin="01:20:52.545" end="01:20:57.244" style="s2">kill her. How could you be so cruel?</p>
<p begin="01:20:55.244" end="01:21:00.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s a woman, yet she won&#39;t care for</p>
<p begin="01:20:57.244" end="01:21:02.344" style="s2">her in-laws or tend to her husband.</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.144" end="01:21:04.344" style="s2">She&#39;s out in public all day,</p>
<p begin="01:21:02.344" end="01:21:06.545" style="s2">scheming against her in-laws.</p>
<p begin="01:21:04.344" end="01:21:08.744" style="s2">What a wicked woman.</p>
<p begin="01:21:06.545" end="01:21:10.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s more vicious than I thought. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:21:08.744" end="01:21:13.344" style="s2">not eating these pastries.</p>
<p begin="01:21:10.945" end="01:21:15.144" style="s2">They could be poisoned too. She wants us</p>
<p begin="01:21:13.344" end="01:21:17.344" style="s2">dead. Exactly.</p>
<p begin="01:21:15.144" end="01:21:19.244" style="s2">They smell so good. Who knows what</p>
<p begin="01:21:17.344" end="01:21:22.144" style="s2">spices she put in them.</p>
<p begin="01:21:19.244" end="01:21:24.244" style="s2">If she added some, she could poison us.</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.144" end="01:21:26.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, that&#39;s not true.</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.244" end="01:21:28.344" style="s2">I made every pastry myself.</p>
<p begin="01:21:26.344" end="01:21:30.744" style="s2">How could they be poisoned?</p>
<p begin="01:21:28.344" end="01:21:33.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, a life for a life.</p>
<p begin="01:21:30.744" end="01:21:33.945" style="s2">Answer to my father today, or I&#39;ll kill</p>
<p begin="01:21:33.244" end="01:21:37.045" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:21:33.945" end="01:21:39.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a bunch of clowns.</p>
<p begin="01:21:37.045" end="01:21:42.744" style="s2">You think hiring people to put on a show</p>
<p begin="01:21:39.744" end="01:21:42.744" style="s2">will bring me down?</p>
<p begin="01:21:42.845" end="01:21:46.745" style="s2">You&#39;ve only made things worse for</p>
<p begin="01:21:44.446" end="01:21:48.646" style="s2">yourselves. If you really cared about</p>
<p begin="01:21:46.745" end="01:21:50.946" style="s2">Hannah, you&#39;d have called a doctor</p>
<p begin="01:21:48.646" end="01:21:53.446" style="s2">already instead of standing here arguing</p>
<p begin="01:21:50.946" end="01:21:53.446" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="01:21:54.646" end="01:21:59.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="01:21:56.345" end="01:21:59.146" style="s2">Doctor&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="01:21:59.546" end="01:22:04.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Friends and neighbors, my delicacy shop</p>
<p begin="01:22:01.745" end="01:22:06.546" style="s2">has been here over three years.</p>
<p begin="01:22:04.046" end="01:22:09.546" style="s2">We&#39;ve never had a scandal. I don&#39;t start</p>
<p begin="01:22:06.546" end="01:22:12.845" style="s2">trouble, but I won&#39;t back down.</p>
<p begin="01:22:09.546" end="01:22:14.845" style="s2">If our pastries really caused this,</p>
<p begin="01:22:12.845" end="01:22:17.345" style="s2">I&#39;ll take full responsibility.</p>
<p begin="01:22:14.845" end="01:22:19.446" style="s2">But if we&#39;re being framed,</p>
<p begin="01:22:17.345" end="01:22:21.345" style="s2">I&#39;ll see this through to the end.</p>
<p begin="01:22:19.446" end="01:22:23.146" style="s2">Doctor, please examine this woman&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:22:21.345" end="01:22:25.745" style="s2">condition and see if she&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="01:22:23.146" end="01:22:25.745" style="s2">poisoned.</p>
<p begin="01:22:33.946" end="01:22:39.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, her vital energies are badly</p>
<p begin="01:22:36.046" end="01:22:41.245" style="s2">disrupted and her pregnancy is failing.</p>
<p begin="01:22:39.546" end="01:22:43.745" style="s2">These are signs of a miscarriage caused</p>
<p begin="01:22:41.245" end="01:22:43.745" style="s2">by poison.</p>
<p begin="01:22:50.146" end="01:22:54.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It really was poison. That landlady&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:22:52.146" end="01:22:57.345" style="s2">vicious. She deserves to drown in a pig</p>
<p begin="01:22:54.345" end="01:22:59.245" style="s2">basket. That landlady looks so kind, but</p>
<p begin="01:22:57.345" end="01:23:02.345" style="s2">she&#39;s cruel to the core.</p>
<p begin="01:22:59.245" end="01:23:03.646" style="s2">She&#39;d even harm an unborn baby.</p>
<p begin="01:23:02.345" end="01:23:07.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To ruin me,</p>
<p begin="01:23:03.646" end="01:23:07.745" style="s2">they&#39;d even stoop to taking a life.</p>
<p begin="01:23:07.845" end="01:23:13.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Husband, it hurts so much. How could we</p>
<p begin="01:23:10.946" end="01:23:16.345" style="s2">lose our baby?</p>
<p begin="01:23:13.646" end="01:23:17.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nina, I won&#39;t let you die.</p>
<p begin="01:23:16.345" end="01:23:19.946" style="s2">Hmph.</p>
<p begin="01:23:17.446" end="01:23:21.046" style="s2">Serena, how dare you harm a child of my</p>
<p begin="01:23:19.946" end="01:23:22.546" style="s2">family?</p>
<p begin="01:23:21.046" end="01:23:24.046" style="s2">Pay with your life.</p>
<p begin="01:23:22.546" end="01:23:27.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do I do?</p>
<p begin="01:23:24.046" end="01:23:27.546" style="s2">She really did lose the baby.</p>
<p begin="01:23:28.046" end="01:23:33.146" style="s2">But I didn&#39;t poison her.</p>
<p begin="01:23:30.745" end="01:23:35.046" style="s2">I didn&#39;t do it.</p>
<p begin="01:23:33.146" end="01:23:37.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too many eyes are on us.</p>
<p begin="01:23:35.046" end="01:23:38.946" style="s2">Since it happened at my place, we need</p>
<p begin="01:23:37.446" end="01:23:41.745" style="s2">to care for her.</p>
<p begin="01:23:38.946" end="01:23:43.946" style="s2">As for who&#39;s behind it,</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.745" end="01:23:46.347" style="s2">the truth is plain to see.</p>
<p begin="01:23:43.946" end="01:23:48.547" style="s2">Someone, take her to the side courtyard.</p>
<p begin="01:23:46.347" end="01:23:51.047" style="s2">Care for her. See if medicine can save</p>
<p begin="01:23:48.547" end="01:23:51.047" style="s2">the baby.</p>
<p begin="01:23:57.147" end="01:24:01.347" style="s2">You said earlier she collapsed after</p>
<p begin="01:23:59.147" end="01:24:03.747" style="s2">tasting a poisoned pastry. Where&#39;s that</p>
<p begin="01:24:01.347" end="01:24:03.747" style="s2">plate?</p>
<p begin="01:24:03.847" end="01:24:06.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is it.</p>
<p begin="01:24:07.247" end="01:24:13.447" style="s2">She took one bite, then had terrible</p>
<p begin="01:24:09.747" end="01:24:15.647" style="s2">stomach pain and collapsed.</p>
<p begin="01:24:13.447" end="01:24:17.447" style="s2">Blood was all over the floor.</p>
<p begin="01:24:15.647" end="01:24:19.847" style="s2">I was terrified.</p>
<p begin="01:24:17.447" end="01:24:23.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doctor, take a look.</p>
<p begin="01:24:19.847" end="01:24:23.747" style="s2">Is anything wrong with these pastries?</p>
<p begin="01:24:32.547" end="01:24:36.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, they smell fine.</p>
<p begin="01:24:34.747" end="01:24:38.547" style="s2">They&#39;re intact.</p>
<p begin="01:24:36.247" end="01:24:41.247" style="s2">The silver needle didn&#39;t change.</p>
<p begin="01:24:38.547" end="01:24:43.047" style="s2">No poison. Impossible.</p>
<p begin="01:24:41.247" end="01:24:44.547" style="s2">The last thing Hannah ate was your</p>
<p begin="01:24:43.047" end="01:24:47.847" style="s2">pastries.</p>
<p begin="01:24:44.547" end="01:24:50.047" style="s2">You swapped the pastries in the chaos.</p>
<p begin="01:24:47.847" end="01:24:52.847" style="s2">You hurt her and want to walk free?</p>
<p begin="01:24:50.047" end="01:24:52.847" style="s2">Not a chance.</p>
<p begin="01:24:54.147" end="01:24:58.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible.</p>
<p begin="01:24:55.647" end="01:25:00.447" style="s2">This is a new recipe I&#39;m trying.</p>
<p begin="01:24:58.347" end="01:25:01.647" style="s2">I made just one plate today for everyone</p>
<p begin="01:25:00.447" end="01:25:02.747" style="s2">to try.</p>
<p begin="01:25:01.647" end="01:25:04.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean</p>
<p begin="01:25:02.747" end="01:25:08.347" style="s2">Hannah ate a poisoned pastry and</p>
<p begin="01:25:04.747" end="01:25:08.347" style="s2">instantly had stomach pain?</p>
<p begin="01:25:10.147" end="01:25:13.347" style="s2">Then fell bleeding?</p>
<p begin="01:25:11.947" end="01:25:15.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What else?</p>
<p begin="01:25:13.347" end="01:25:18.147" style="s2">It&#39;s come to this.</p>
<p begin="01:25:15.347" end="01:25:18.947" style="s2">Pay $10,000 in gold or this won&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="01:25:18.147" end="01:25:19.947" style="s2">over.</p>
<p begin="01:25:18.947" end="01:25:22.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mum,</p>
<p begin="01:25:19.947" end="01:25:27.347" style="s2">if you say I poisoned her, why did she</p>
<p begin="01:25:22.547" end="01:25:27.347" style="s2">collapse in pain after just one pastry?</p>
<p begin="01:25:27.447" end="01:25:33.147" style="s2">And how could I have known which pastry</p>
<p begin="01:25:29.747" end="01:25:34.547" style="s2">she&#39;d eat and poisoned that exact one?</p>
<p begin="01:25:33.147" end="01:25:36.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam has a point.</p>
<p begin="01:25:34.547" end="01:25:38.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She clearly took poison before she ate</p>
<p begin="01:25:36.947" end="01:25:41.447" style="s2">the pastry.</p>
<p begin="01:25:38.547" end="01:25:43.347" style="s2">To frame our delicacy shop on purpose.</p>
<p begin="01:25:41.447" end="01:25:44.948" style="s2">You want to frame me?</p>
<p begin="01:25:43.347" end="01:25:47.549" style="s2">Couldn&#39;t you come up with a better</p>
<p begin="01:25:44.948" end="01:25:50.149" style="s2">scheme?</p>
<p begin="01:25:47.549" end="01:25:50.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, oh.</p>
<p begin="01:25:50.249" end="01:25:54.349" style="s2">Come to think of it,</p>
<p begin="01:25:52.149" end="01:25:57.149" style="s2">she&#39;s right. If they&#39;d meant to poison</p>
<p begin="01:25:54.349" end="01:25:58.649" style="s2">her, they&#39;d have poisoned every pastry.</p>
<p begin="01:25:57.149" end="01:26:01.349" style="s2">How could she pick the one poisoned</p>
<p begin="01:25:58.649" end="01:26:03.349" style="s2">pastry? Back in the capital, I&#39;d heard</p>
<p begin="01:26:01.349" end="01:26:05.448" style="s2">that Widow Crawford was nasty and</p>
<p begin="01:26:03.349" end="01:26:08.349" style="s2">greedy. I wouldn&#39;t put something this</p>
<p begin="01:26:05.448" end="01:26:08.349" style="s2">vile past her.</p>
<p begin="01:26:10.049" end="01:26:14.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, that&#39;s not what happened. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:26:12.349" end="01:26:16.649" style="s2">listen to him.</p>
<p begin="01:26:14.249" end="01:26:19.049" style="s2">Don&#39;t listen to him. Hannah has a good</p>
<p begin="01:26:16.649" end="01:26:21.649" style="s2">heart. Why would she risk her own child</p>
<p begin="01:26:19.049" end="01:26:22.349" style="s2">just to frame you? Serena, stop making</p>
<p begin="01:26:21.649" end="01:26:24.349" style="s2">things up.</p>
<p begin="01:26:22.349" end="01:26:28.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t believe</p>
<p begin="01:26:24.349" end="01:26:28.448" style="s2">a mother would hurt her own child.</p>
<p begin="01:26:28.849" end="01:26:33.549" style="s2">But you&#39;re different. You faked your</p>
<p begin="01:26:30.948" end="01:26:35.649" style="s2">death to run away, Victor.</p>
<p begin="01:26:33.549" end="01:26:37.448" style="s2">Even beasts protect their young, but for</p>
<p begin="01:26:35.649" end="01:26:41.249" style="s2">your own selfish ends,</p>
<p begin="01:26:37.448" end="01:26:41.249" style="s2">you abandoned your own child.</p>
<p begin="01:26:43.849" end="01:26:48.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s just your guess.</p>
<p begin="01:26:46.149" end="01:26:52.448" style="s2">You have no proof it happened in your</p>
<p begin="01:26:48.249" end="01:26:52.448" style="s2">shop, so you&#39;re responsible for it.</p>
<p begin="01:26:52.749" end="01:26:56.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forgive me, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="01:26:54.448" end="01:26:57.948" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t save the child.</p>
<p begin="01:26:56.448" end="01:26:59.749" style="s2">The lady lost too much blood, and</p>
<p begin="01:26:57.948" end="01:27:01.249" style="s2">treatment came too late.</p>
<p begin="01:26:59.749" end="01:27:03.249" style="s2">The baby</p>
<p begin="01:27:01.249" end="01:27:04.349" style="s2">didn&#39;t survive.</p>
<p begin="01:27:03.249" end="01:27:06.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:27:04.349" end="01:27:08.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But when I examined her pulse closely,</p>
<p begin="01:27:06.549" end="01:27:11.549" style="s2">the signs of stagnation weren&#39;t caused</p>
<p begin="01:27:08.749" end="01:27:13.649" style="s2">by poison. It seems she took a large</p>
<p begin="01:27:11.549" end="01:27:15.149" style="s2">dose of safflower, disrupting her</p>
<p begin="01:27:13.649" end="01:27:17.249" style="s2">circulation</p>
<p begin="01:27:15.149" end="01:27:18.948" style="s2">and causing a miscarriage.</p>
<p begin="01:27:17.249" end="01:27:20.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Safflower?</p>
<p begin="01:27:18.948" end="01:27:23.549" style="s2">Every pharmacy stocks it. They&#39;ll have</p>
<p begin="01:27:20.849" end="01:27:25.149" style="s2">purchase and sales records.</p>
<p begin="01:27:23.549" end="01:27:26.749" style="s2">Someone, come here.</p>
<p begin="01:27:25.149" end="01:27:28.549" style="s2">Check the safflower records at every</p>
<p begin="01:27:26.749" end="01:27:29.849" style="s2">pharmacy in town, now.</p>
<p begin="01:27:28.549" end="01:27:32.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:27:29.849" end="01:27:33.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is there to check?</p>
<p begin="01:27:32.349" end="01:27:35.948" style="s2">You vicious woman.</p>
<p begin="01:27:33.948" end="01:27:38.049" style="s2">You conspired with the doctor and led</p>
<p begin="01:27:35.948" end="01:27:41.249" style="s2">Hannah to the side courtyard to destroy</p>
<p begin="01:27:38.049" end="01:27:41.249" style="s2">my family&#39;s bloodline.</p>
<p begin="01:27:41.448" end="01:27:45.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re just checking a few ledgers to</p>
<p begin="01:27:43.149" end="01:27:48.249" style="s2">find out who poisoned Hannah, and you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:27:45.849" end="01:27:50.550" style="s2">flying off the handle.</p>
<p begin="01:27:48.249" end="01:27:53.750" style="s2">I&#39;m not the one with a secret.</p>
<p begin="01:27:50.550" end="01:27:53.750" style="s2">You&#39;re acting guilty.</p>
<p begin="01:27:58.850" end="01:28:03.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, we have a lead.</p>
<p begin="01:28:00.750" end="01:28:04.550" style="s2">A North District doctor says</p>
<p begin="01:28:03.150" end="01:28:06.550" style="s2">few days ago</p>
<p begin="01:28:04.550" end="01:28:07.450" style="s2">someone bought a lot of safflower from</p>
<p begin="01:28:06.550" end="01:28:09.950" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="01:28:07.450" end="01:28:12.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doctor, take a good look.</p>
<p begin="01:28:09.950" end="01:28:17.150" style="s2">Did anyone here buy safflower from you?</p>
<p begin="01:28:12.650" end="01:28:17.150" style="s2">Speak freely. I&#39;ll have your back.</p>
<p begin="01:28:19.250" end="01:28:24.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, two days ago this man came alone</p>
<p begin="01:28:22.350" end="01:28:28.350" style="s2">to my pharmacy. He bought two doses of</p>
<p begin="01:28:24.950" end="01:28:30.450" style="s2">tonic and lots of safflower. He was tall</p>
<p begin="01:28:28.350" end="01:28:31.950" style="s2">but seemed in a hurry. I thought it was</p>
<p begin="01:28:30.450" end="01:28:34.750" style="s2">odd at the time.</p>
<p begin="01:28:31.950" end="01:28:37.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you? I&#39;m a sixth-rank military</p>
<p begin="01:28:34.750" end="01:28:39.450" style="s2">officer. You dare slander me? Tell me</p>
<p begin="01:28:37.650" end="01:28:41.650" style="s2">who put you up to this.</p>
<p begin="01:28:39.450" end="01:28:45.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wouldn&#39;t lie, madam.</p>
<p begin="01:28:41.650" end="01:28:45.750" style="s2">I brought my ledgers. They&#39;re genuine.</p>
<p begin="01:28:46.521" end="01:28:50.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:28:47.650" end="01:28:51.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The evidence is clear. Still denying it,</p>
<p begin="01:28:50.450" end="01:28:52.050" style="s2">guards?</p>
<p begin="01:28:51.450" end="01:28:54.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah.</p>
<p begin="01:28:52.050" end="01:28:57.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold Victor and his son down tight.</p>
<p begin="01:28:54.250" end="01:28:57.250" style="s2">Don&#39;t let him get away.</p>
<p begin="01:28:57.750" end="01:29:02.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So Victor really was behind it. To frame</p>
<p begin="01:29:00.250" end="01:29:04.850" style="s2">his own daughter-in-law, he&#39;d even harm</p>
<p begin="01:29:02.250" end="01:29:07.650" style="s2">his own child. Even beasts spare their</p>
<p begin="01:29:04.850" end="01:29:10.350" style="s2">young. What he did was monstrous. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:29:07.650" end="01:29:12.950" style="s2">unfit to be a husband, unfit husband.</p>
<p begin="01:29:10.350" end="01:29:14.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, my father isn&#39;t like that.</p>
<p begin="01:29:12.950" end="01:29:17.650" style="s2">Serena is behind all this.</p>
<p begin="01:29:14.850" end="01:29:20.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you still show no remorse? Guards,</p>
<p begin="01:29:17.650" end="01:29:24.450" style="s2">bring Hannah out here. She started all</p>
<p begin="01:29:20.250" end="01:29:24.450" style="s2">this. Let her be the one to end it.</p>
<p begin="01:29:26.150" end="01:29:31.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, you vicious woman.</p>
<p begin="01:29:28.650" end="01:29:33.550" style="s2">You killed my child. You did. You&#39;ll pay</p>
<p begin="01:29:31.950" end="01:29:36.550" style="s2">for this one day.</p>
<p begin="01:29:33.550" end="01:29:40.350" style="s2">Heaven sees everything we do.</p>
<p begin="01:29:36.550" end="01:29:42.050" style="s2">Hannah, your reckoning is here.</p>
<p begin="01:29:40.350" end="01:29:43.750" style="s2">The ledger I have shows Hannah Crawford</p>
<p begin="01:29:42.050" end="01:29:46.350" style="s2">took payments in Green Hills from the</p>
<p begin="01:29:43.750" end="01:29:47.350" style="s2">Red Society for contraband salt.</p>
<p begin="01:29:46.350" end="01:29:48.850" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="01:29:47.350" end="01:29:50.550" style="s2">That&#39;s nonsense.</p>
<p begin="01:29:48.850" end="01:29:51.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, when did you investigate Hannah</p>
<p begin="01:29:50.550" end="01:29:53.151" style="s2">in Green</p>
<p begin="01:29:51.751" end="01:29:56.052" style="s2">I had no idea.</p>
<p begin="01:29:53.151" end="01:29:57.651" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, thank manager Smith.</p>
<p begin="01:29:56.052" end="01:30:00.151" style="s2">He often deals with Green Hills</p>
<p begin="01:29:57.651" end="01:30:03.151" style="s2">merchants and heard rumors there.</p>
<p begin="01:30:00.151" end="01:30:06.651" style="s2">I&#39;ve kept quiet waiting for this moment.</p>
<p begin="01:30:03.151" end="01:30:06.651" style="s2">Now we can catch them all.</p>
<p begin="01:30:07.552" end="01:30:10.951" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Old madam, the salt merchant Crawford&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:30:09.351" end="01:30:12.751" style="s2">ledgers you asked me to check do show</p>
<p begin="01:30:10.951" end="01:30:14.052" style="s2">something wrong. I had someone copy the</p>
<p begin="01:30:12.751" end="01:30:15.851" style="s2">real accounts.</p>
<p begin="01:30:14.052" end="01:30:17.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When Hannah lived in Green Hills, she</p>
<p begin="01:30:15.851" end="01:30:19.751" style="s2">used her salt merchant status to bully</p>
<p begin="01:30:17.552" end="01:30:21.751" style="s2">the locals. To monopolize the salt</p>
<p begin="01:30:19.751" end="01:30:24.151" style="s2">trade, she secretly colluded with local</p>
<p begin="01:30:21.751" end="01:30:25.751" style="s2">officials and smuggled contraband salt.</p>
<p begin="01:30:24.151" end="01:30:27.052" style="s2">Her ill-gotten gains totaled over</p>
<p begin="01:30:25.751" end="01:30:29.851" style="s2">$100,000.</p>
<p begin="01:30:27.052" end="01:30:32.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Over $200,000? That&#39;s That much money</p>
<p begin="01:30:29.851" end="01:30:33.851" style="s2">could last me several lifetimes. You</p>
<p begin="01:30:32.052" end="01:30:35.552" style="s2">vicious woman, you stole the people&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:30:33.851" end="01:30:37.651" style="s2">hard-earned money. That&#39;s as good as</p>
<p begin="01:30:35.552" end="01:30:41.751" style="s2">killing us. Give back every penny.</p>
<p begin="01:30:37.651" end="01:30:43.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I I spent all my money long ago.</p>
<p begin="01:30:41.751" end="01:30:46.151" style="s2">I&#39;m broke.</p>
<p begin="01:30:43.851" end="01:30:48.851" style="s2">Please, I lost my child.</p>
<p begin="01:30:46.151" end="01:30:50.052" style="s2">Have mercy on me.</p>
<p begin="01:30:48.851" end="01:30:52.151" style="s2">Mercy,</p>
<p begin="01:30:50.052" end="01:30:54.451" style="s2">when you prayed on the people,</p>
<p begin="01:30:52.151" end="01:30:56.851" style="s2">when you used your unborn child to frame</p>
<p begin="01:30:54.451" end="01:30:58.052" style="s2">Serena, [music] did you think this day</p>
<p begin="01:30:56.851" end="01:31:00.451" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t come?</p>
<p begin="01:30:58.052" end="01:31:02.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, let the local guards handle the</p>
<p begin="01:31:00.451" end="01:31:04.151" style="s2">rest.</p>
<p begin="01:31:02.251" end="01:31:07.552" style="s2">Guards, take Hannah Crawford to the</p>
<p begin="01:31:04.151" end="01:31:07.552" style="s2">magistrate for questioning.</p>
<p begin="01:31:13.552" end="01:31:18.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, everything was my fault. I finally</p>
<p begin="01:31:16.552" end="01:31:21.151" style="s2">see the Crawford aunt and niece for who</p>
<p begin="01:31:18.251" end="01:31:23.751" style="s2">they are. I&#39;ve cut all ties with them.</p>
<p begin="01:31:21.151" end="01:31:25.651" style="s2">Mom, I&#39;m your only son. Please forgive</p>
<p begin="01:31:23.751" end="01:31:26.151" style="s2">me. Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:31:25.651" end="01:31:28.451" style="s2">Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:31:26.151" end="01:31:31.951" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Old madam, didn&#39;t you tell me your son</p>
<p begin="01:31:28.451" end="01:31:31.951" style="s2">died 3 years ago?</p>
<p begin="01:31:34.851" end="01:31:38.951" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, I have urgent family business</p>
<p begin="01:31:37.052" end="01:31:40.552" style="s2">today. The sock weaving shop will close</p>
<p begin="01:31:38.951" end="01:31:43.451" style="s2">for the day. Please forgive the</p>
<p begin="01:31:40.552" end="01:31:43.451" style="s2">inconvenience.</p>
<p begin="01:31:44.851" end="01:31:50.351" style="s2">Your Majesty, I bow before you.</p>
<p begin="01:31:48.351" end="01:31:51.251" style="s2">Please punish me for deceiving the</p>
<p begin="01:31:50.351" end="01:31:55.452" style="s2">crown.</p>
<p begin="01:31:51.251" end="01:31:58.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, then tell me how did you deceive me?</p>
<p begin="01:31:55.452" end="01:32:01.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, walls have ears. Could we</p>
<p begin="01:31:58.153" end="01:32:01.352" style="s2">speak in the side courtyard?</p>
<p begin="01:32:03.653" end="01:32:08.552" style="s2">Your Majesty, I&#39;m Julian&#39;s wife. Three</p>
<p begin="01:32:06.153" end="01:32:10.352" style="s2">years ago, his father Victor and Julian</p>
<p begin="01:32:08.552" end="01:32:11.952" style="s2">were believed killed in battle. My</p>
<p begin="01:32:10.352" end="01:32:14.153" style="s2">mother-in-law and I removed them from</p>
<p begin="01:32:11.952" end="01:32:16.052" style="s2">the family registry, sold our property,</p>
<p begin="01:32:14.153" end="01:32:18.653" style="s2">and moved to Silk River City.</p>
<p begin="01:32:16.052" end="01:32:19.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s hardly deceiving the emperor.</p>
<p begin="01:32:18.653" end="01:32:21.552" style="s2">Please get up.</p>
<p begin="01:32:19.752" end="01:32:23.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Your Majesty.</p>
<p begin="01:32:21.552" end="01:32:26.552" style="s2">Victor and Julian never died. They</p>
<p begin="01:32:23.852" end="01:32:28.752" style="s2">deserted, staged their deaths, abandoned</p>
<p begin="01:32:26.552" end="01:32:30.452" style="s2">wife and mother, and fled with Hannah</p>
<p begin="01:32:28.752" end="01:32:31.952" style="s2">and Amanda Crawford.</p>
<p begin="01:32:30.452" end="01:32:34.052" style="s2">I knew desertion could doom nine</p>
<p begin="01:32:31.952" end="01:32:36.352" style="s2">generations. I couldn&#39;t bear to tell her</p>
<p begin="01:32:34.052" end="01:32:37.252" style="s2">she&#39;d lost her son, so I kept it secret</p>
<p begin="01:32:36.352" end="01:32:38.352" style="s2">all this time.</p>
<p begin="01:32:37.252" end="01:32:39.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:32:38.352" end="01:32:42.153" style="s2">How dare you?</p>
<p begin="01:32:39.752" end="01:32:43.752" style="s2">Victor, a sixth-rank military officer,</p>
<p begin="01:32:42.153" end="01:32:46.252" style="s2">sworn to serve your emperor and defend</p>
<p begin="01:32:43.752" end="01:32:47.952" style="s2">our borders. Yet you and Julian fled the</p>
<p begin="01:32:46.252" end="01:32:48.752" style="s2">battlefield and brought shame upon</p>
<p begin="01:32:47.952" end="01:32:51.352" style="s2">yourselves.</p>
<p begin="01:32:48.752" end="01:32:52.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, we&#39;re innocent. Serena is</p>
<p begin="01:32:51.352" end="01:32:54.352" style="s2">lying.</p>
<p begin="01:32:52.452" end="01:32:55.852" style="s2">Julian and I marched north. We fell into</p>
<p begin="01:32:54.352" end="01:32:57.752" style="s2">an enemy trap.</p>
<p begin="01:32:55.852" end="01:32:59.653" style="s2">That&#39;s how the mistake began.</p>
<p begin="01:32:57.752" end="01:33:01.552" style="s2">Everyone thought we died in battle. The</p>
<p begin="01:32:59.653" end="01:33:03.153" style="s2">Crawfords later rescued us, and we made</p>
<p begin="01:33:01.552" end="01:33:05.153" style="s2">it back to the capital.</p>
<p begin="01:33:03.153" end="01:33:07.852" style="s2">We never faked our deaths.</p>
<p begin="01:33:05.153" end="01:33:09.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, grant me justice.</p>
<p begin="01:33:07.852" end="01:33:11.653" style="s2">If they hadn&#39;t deserted an abandoned</p>
<p begin="01:33:09.552" end="01:33:13.653" style="s2">wife and mother, why return only after</p>
<p begin="01:33:11.653" end="01:33:15.452" style="s2">three years? Victor even threatened to</p>
<p begin="01:33:13.653" end="01:33:17.252" style="s2">replace me as lady of the house and</p>
<p begin="01:33:15.452" end="01:33:19.352" style="s2">marry another.</p>
<p begin="01:33:17.252" end="01:33:21.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, [music] I have proof that</p>
<p begin="01:33:19.352" end="01:33:24.252" style="s2">Victor and Julian conspired in secret to</p>
<p begin="01:33:21.852" end="01:33:26.852" style="s2">fake their deaths and desert.</p>
<p begin="01:33:24.252" end="01:33:26.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring it here.</p>
<p begin="01:33:29.052" end="01:33:32.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The day we heard they died in battle, I</p>
<p begin="01:33:31.052" end="01:33:35.852" style="s2">went through Julian&#39;s belongings and</p>
<p begin="01:33:32.752" end="01:33:36.952" style="s2">found notes they secretly exchanged.</p>
<p begin="01:33:35.852" end="01:33:38.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor,</p>
<p begin="01:33:36.952" end="01:33:39.653" style="s2">Julian,</p>
<p begin="01:33:38.052" end="01:33:41.153" style="s2">the evidence is clear.</p>
<p begin="01:33:39.653" end="01:33:44.552" style="s2">Will you still deny it?</p>
<p begin="01:33:41.153" end="01:33:47.352" style="s2">All deserters must die.</p>
<p begin="01:33:44.552" end="01:33:49.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is that possible, Dad?</p>
<p begin="01:33:47.352" end="01:33:52.452" style="s2">We made our plans face-to-face. What</p>
<p begin="01:33:49.952" end="01:33:55.452" style="s2">notes could she have?</p>
<p begin="01:33:52.452" end="01:33:59.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those notes? I forged the handwriting.</p>
<p begin="01:33:55.452" end="01:34:01.154" style="s2">Victor, Julian, you fell for it.</p>
<p begin="01:33:59.554" end="01:34:02.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You vicious woman,</p>
<p begin="01:34:01.154" end="01:34:05.054" style="s2">you dared to trick us.</p>
<p begin="01:34:02.954" end="01:34:07.554" style="s2">I&#39;ll kill you.</p>
<p begin="01:34:05.054" end="01:34:10.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you attack her here?</p>
<p begin="01:34:07.554" end="01:34:13.154" style="s2">Guards,</p>
<p begin="01:34:10.154" end="01:34:16.054" style="s2">hold Victor and Julian down.</p>
<p begin="01:34:13.154" end="01:34:16.054" style="s2">Behead them soon.</p>
<p begin="01:34:16.354" end="01:34:20.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One stroke can&#39;t satisfy my hatred.</p>
<p begin="01:34:21.154" end="01:34:24.154" style="s2">Sire,</p>
<p begin="01:34:22.354" end="01:34:27.854" style="s2">the Vance father and son deserve no</p>
<p begin="01:34:24.154" end="01:34:30.154" style="s2">mercy, but Julian was once my husband.</p>
<p begin="01:34:27.854" end="01:34:32.054" style="s2">I beg your majesty for mercy.</p>
<p begin="01:34:30.154" end="01:34:34.954" style="s2">Make an exception.</p>
<p begin="01:34:32.054" end="01:34:34.954" style="s2">Spare their lives.</p>
<p begin="01:34:36.454" end="01:34:41.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sire,</p>
<p begin="01:34:38.654" end="01:34:43.754" style="s2">please for the sake of my</p>
<p begin="01:34:41.554" end="01:34:45.654" style="s2">blood ties to Jason,</p>
<p begin="01:34:43.754" end="01:34:48.254" style="s2">let them live.</p>
<p begin="01:34:45.654" end="01:34:51.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You too have shown great virtue,</p>
<p begin="01:34:48.254" end="01:34:54.354" style="s2">and you once saved my life.</p>
<p begin="01:34:51.154" end="01:34:56.054" style="s2">I spare them, but not punishment.</p>
<p begin="01:34:54.354" end="01:34:58.154" style="s2">By my decree,</p>
<p begin="01:34:56.054" end="01:35:00.254" style="s2">send the Vance father and son 1,000</p>
<p begin="01:34:58.154" end="01:35:04.154" style="s2">miles to the frozen frontier for penal</p>
<p begin="01:35:00.254" end="01:35:04.154" style="s2">labor. They shall never return.</p>
<p begin="01:35:04.354" end="01:35:07.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, sire.</p>
<p begin="01:35:07.654" end="01:35:11.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, why did you plead for them that</p>
<p begin="01:35:09.854" end="01:35:14.354" style="s2">day?</p>
<p begin="01:35:11.954" end="01:35:17.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In the imperial throne room, you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:35:14.354" end="01:35:17.954" style="s2">need a blade to kill someone.</p>
<p begin="01:35:21.654" end="01:35:25.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ahem.</p>
<p begin="01:35:23.354" end="01:35:25.654" style="s2">Ahem.</p>
<p begin="01:35:27.554" end="01:35:31.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian, long time no see.</p>
<p begin="01:35:30.754" end="01:35:33.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You witch.</p>
<p begin="01:35:31.554" end="01:35:35.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You haven&#39;t heard what happened to the</p>
<p begin="01:35:33.054" end="01:35:37.254" style="s2">Crawford aunt and niece?</p>
<p begin="01:35:35.254" end="01:35:38.854" style="s2">They sold contraband salt, took bribes,</p>
<p begin="01:35:37.254" end="01:35:40.754" style="s2">and broke the law, and angered his</p>
<p begin="01:35:38.854" end="01:35:43.254" style="s2">majesty. All Hannah&#39;s assets were</p>
<p begin="01:35:40.754" end="01:35:45.054" style="s2">seized. Their accomplices were punished.</p>
<p begin="01:35:43.254" end="01:35:45.654" style="s2">Even your beloved Amanda was publicly</p>
<p begin="01:35:45.054" end="01:35:47.154" style="s2">beheaded.</p>
<p begin="01:35:45.654" end="01:35:48.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll kill you.</p>
<p begin="01:35:47.154" end="01:35:50.854" style="s2">I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:35:48.654" end="01:35:50.854" style="s2">move.</p>
<p begin="01:35:56.554" end="01:36:01.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, it&#39;s windy out here. Let&#39;s go</p>
<p begin="01:35:58.555" end="01:36:01.156" style="s2">inside.</p>
<p begin="01:36:01.455" end="01:36:05.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come.</p>
<p begin="01:36:02.555" end="01:36:05.555" style="s2">It&#39;s later now.</p>
<p begin="01:36:06.256" end="01:36:11.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Later, mom&#39;s silk embroidery grew more</p>
<p begin="01:36:08.756" end="01:36:13.955" style="s2">renowned by the day. Her work was sent</p>
<p begin="01:36:11.156" end="01:36:16.356" style="s2">to the palace. Even the Empress Dowager</p>
<p begin="01:36:13.955" end="01:36:18.756" style="s2">raved about it and rewarded her with</p>
<p begin="01:36:16.356" end="01:36:20.656" style="s2">jade bangles.</p>
<p begin="01:36:18.756" end="01:36:23.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, the Empress Dowager gave you these</p>
<p begin="01:36:20.656" end="01:36:25.455" style="s2">jade bangles. Try them on.</p>
<p begin="01:36:23.256" end="01:36:27.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, I&#39;m too old for these.</p>
<p begin="01:36:25.455" end="01:36:29.256" style="s2">They&#39;re much too flashy on me.</p>
<p begin="01:36:27.555" end="01:36:31.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, you should wear them.</p>
<p begin="01:36:29.256" end="01:36:33.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, come on, mom. The Empress Dowager</p>
<p begin="01:36:31.656" end="01:36:36.055" style="s2">gave them to you.</p>
<p begin="01:36:33.955" end="01:36:38.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You earned this as Evelyn Vance in your</p>
<p begin="01:36:36.055" end="01:36:39.455" style="s2">own right. Come here. I&#39;ll put them on</p>
<p begin="01:36:38.356" end="01:36:42.356" style="s2">you myself.</p>
<p begin="01:36:39.455" end="01:36:43.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow, master, your bangles are gorgeous.</p>
<p begin="01:36:42.356" end="01:36:44.955" style="s2">When will I ever be as skilled an</p>
<p begin="01:36:43.656" end="01:36:46.856" style="s2">embroiderer as you?</p>
<p begin="01:36:44.955" end="01:36:48.856" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, your jade bangles looked a</p>
<p begin="01:36:46.856" end="01:36:50.356" style="s2">little plain alone, so I found this</p>
<p begin="01:36:48.856" end="01:36:52.356" style="s2">hairpin to match them.</p>
<p begin="01:36:50.356" end="01:36:54.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, let [music] me put it on you.</p>
<p begin="01:36:52.356" end="01:36:56.756" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. How thoughtful of you.</p>
<p begin="01:36:54.555" end="01:36:59.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, my embroidery isn&#39;t good enough</p>
<p begin="01:36:56.756" end="01:37:02.356" style="s2">to make you a proper New Year&#39;s gift.</p>
<p begin="01:36:59.055" end="01:37:04.555" style="s2">Three kowtows, master. A happy New Year,</p>
<p begin="01:37:02.356" end="01:37:07.156" style="s2">a long life, enduring acclaim for your</p>
<p begin="01:37:04.555" end="01:37:08.912" style="s2">art, and glory year after year.</p>
<p begin="01:37:07.156" end="01:37:10.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re also thoughtful.</p>
<p begin="01:37:08.912" end="01:37:13.555" style="s2">[music] Get up, all of you.</p>
<p begin="01:37:10.955" end="01:37:16.856" style="s2">Study hard under me. You&#39;ll all make</p>
<p begin="01:37:13.555" end="01:37:16.856" style="s2">names for yourselves.</p>
<p begin="01:37:17.055" end="01:37:21.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was no longer the Vance matriarch,</p>
<p begin="01:37:19.256" end="01:37:22.356" style="s2">trapped at home and at her husband&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:37:21.055" end="01:37:24.955" style="s2">mercy.</p>
<p begin="01:37:22.356" end="01:37:26.856" style="s2">She was Evelyn. She ran her own</p>
<p begin="01:37:24.955" end="01:37:30.455" style="s2">embroidery shop.</p>
<p begin="01:37:26.856" end="01:37:32.055" style="s2">A revered embroidery master.</p>
<p begin="01:37:30.455" end="01:37:34.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally, we&#39;ve picked the shop</p>
<p begin="01:37:32.055" end="01:37:35.555" style="s2">locations. I&#39;m exhausted from all this</p>
<p begin="01:37:34.455" end="01:37:37.756" style="s2">work.</p>
<p begin="01:37:35.555" end="01:37:39.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve worked hard, Serena.</p>
<p begin="01:37:37.756" end="01:37:42.856" style="s2">Have some water and rest.</p>
<p begin="01:37:39.656" end="01:37:42.856" style="s2">How many shops did you pick?</p>
<p begin="01:37:43.555" end="01:37:48.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll open another silk shop. The pastry</p>
<p begin="01:37:46.156" end="01:37:51.256" style="s2">shop will open branches in the west,</p>
<p begin="01:37:48.555" end="01:37:52.856" style="s2">north, and east districts. Then people</p>
<p begin="01:37:51.256" end="01:37:55.256" style="s2">won&#39;t all have to crowd the south</p>
<p begin="01:37:52.856" end="01:37:57.356" style="s2">district shop to buy pastries.</p>
<p begin="01:37:55.256" end="01:37:59.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, you have a real gift for</p>
<p begin="01:37:57.356" end="01:38:02.357" style="s2">business.</p>
<p begin="01:37:59.656" end="01:38:05.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, the embroidery shop is steady, and</p>
<p begin="01:38:02.357" end="01:38:07.156" style="s2">delicacy shop is thriving, but few women</p>
<p begin="01:38:05.357" end="01:38:10.056" style="s2">run businesses.</p>
<p begin="01:38:07.156" end="01:38:14.056" style="s2">I&#39;ve always had a dream.</p>
<p begin="01:38:10.056" end="01:38:14.056" style="s2">I want to open a bookstore for women.</p>
<p begin="01:38:14.757" end="01:38:20.257" style="s2">So women confined to their homes can</p>
<p begin="01:38:16.757" end="01:38:23.257" style="s2">show their talents to the world.</p>
<p begin="01:38:20.257" end="01:38:25.457" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. It could publish stories and poems</p>
<p begin="01:38:23.257" end="01:38:27.457" style="s2">written by women.</p>
<p begin="01:38:25.457" end="01:38:30.056" style="s2">It would show the world how talented</p>
<p begin="01:38:27.457" end="01:38:32.257" style="s2">women are, and they could earn a living</p>
<p begin="01:38:30.056" end="01:38:34.957" style="s2">with their skills instead of depending</p>
<p begin="01:38:32.257" end="01:38:34.957" style="s2">on others.</p>
<p begin="01:38:35.156" end="01:38:39.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right, mom.</p>
<p begin="01:38:38.056" end="01:38:42.857" style="s2">Why wait for another day? Let&#39;s start</p>
<p begin="01:38:39.957" end="01:38:42.857" style="s2">building it now.</p>
<p begin="01:38:49.056" end="01:38:54.257" style="s2">Everyone, welcome to Fanghua bookstore.</p>
<p begin="01:38:52.156" end="01:38:56.757" style="s2">We sell poetry and illustrated stories</p>
<p begin="01:38:54.257" end="01:38:59.056" style="s2">by women from across the land.</p>
<p begin="01:38:56.757" end="01:39:00.857" style="s2">Come in and take a look.</p>
<p begin="01:38:59.056" end="01:39:02.957" style="s2">If you have a dream</p>
<p begin="01:39:00.857" end="01:39:05.757" style="s2">and a manuscript,</p>
<p begin="01:39:02.957" end="01:39:07.556" style="s2">submit it here for print.</p>
<p begin="01:39:05.757" end="01:39:10.257" style="s2">Stand on talent.</p>
<p begin="01:39:07.556" end="01:39:10.257" style="s2">Write your name.</p>
<p begin="01:39:13.656" end="01:39:19.757" style="s2">Oh my god, I found a poem I wrote.</p>
<p begin="01:39:16.556" end="01:39:22.757" style="s2">They even printed my name on it.</p>
<p begin="01:39:19.757" end="01:39:25.457" style="s2">It&#39;s nice to see my name without his.</p>
<p begin="01:39:22.757" end="01:39:28.757" style="s2">People say women have narrow minds</p>
<p begin="01:39:25.457" end="01:39:28.757" style="s2">and belong at home.</p>
<p begin="01:39:29.056" end="01:39:33.156" style="s2">But now I see</p>
<p begin="01:39:30.757" end="01:39:35.857" style="s2">our talent and learning are every bit as</p>
<p begin="01:39:33.156" end="01:39:39.156" style="s2">good as men&#39;s. I wrote poems in my past</p>
<p begin="01:39:35.857" end="01:39:41.357" style="s2">life too, but never dared show anyone</p>
<p begin="01:39:39.156" end="01:39:43.156" style="s2">because Julian said writing poetry</p>
<p begin="01:39:41.357" end="01:39:44.957" style="s2">wasn&#39;t a woman&#39;s place.</p>
<p begin="01:39:43.156" end="01:39:46.957" style="s2">But now I&#39;ve proven through my actions</p>
<p begin="01:39:44.957" end="01:39:48.957" style="s2">that women everywhere can hold their</p>
<p begin="01:39:46.957" end="01:39:51.457" style="s2">heads high and make a name through</p>
<p begin="01:39:48.957" end="01:39:51.457" style="s2">writing.</p>
<p begin="01:39:55.056" end="01:40:00.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, Serena,</p>
<p begin="01:39:57.257" end="01:40:01.656" style="s2">having you by my side in life leaves me</p>
<p begin="01:40:00.156" end="01:40:04.357" style="s2">with no regrets.</p>
<p begin="01:40:01.656" end="01:40:06.558" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, if you&#39;re tired, sleep.</p>
<p begin="01:40:04.357" end="01:40:09.858" style="s2">Serena&#39;s right here with you.</p>
<p begin="01:40:06.558" end="01:40:11.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena, let me see you smile once more.</p>
<p begin="01:40:09.858" end="01:40:13.358" style="s2">Eat well.</p>
<p begin="01:40:11.258" end="01:40:15.158" style="s2">Don&#39;t work too hard.</p>
<p begin="01:40:13.358" end="01:40:18.358" style="s2">And don&#39;t cry for me.</p>
<p begin="01:40:15.158" end="01:40:20.758" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t cry. I&#39;ll smile. I&#39;ll be okay,</p>
<p begin="01:40:18.358" end="01:40:20.758" style="s2">mom.</p>
<p begin="01:40:26.058" end="01:40:30.358" style="s2">He wouldn&#39;t want us crying for him.</p>
<p begin="01:40:28.358" end="01:40:31.458" style="s2">He&#39;d want to see us doing well, happy</p>
<p begin="01:40:30.358" end="01:40:34.258" style="s2">every single day.</p>
<p begin="01:40:31.458" end="01:40:38.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, okay. We won&#39;t cry. We won&#39;t. They</p>
<p begin="01:40:34.258" end="01:40:40.758" style="s2">say without a husband or home, we drift.</p>
<p begin="01:40:38.258" end="01:40:42.958" style="s2">But what they don&#39;t know is a rotten</p>
<p begin="01:40:40.758" end="01:40:46.658" style="s2">home isn&#39;t worth keeping.</p>
<p begin="01:40:42.958" end="01:40:46.658" style="s2">Leave a man you can&#39;t count on</p>
<p begin="01:40:47.029" end="01:40:51.858" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:40:48.158" end="01:40:51.858" style="s2">to ourselves and to freedom.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
